//@version=6
indicator("ONR Book v2.7 (50% add-on) - Lucid Flex / Topstep (overnight reversion + opening drive)", shorttitle = "ONR Book 50%", overlay = true, max_lines_count = 500, max_labels_count = 500, max_boxes_count = 500)

// =====================================================================================================================
// ONR BOOK v2.7, 50% CONSISTENCY ADD-ON EDITION (2026-11-27). Chart: MNQ1! (or NQ1!), 1-5 minute bars, 24h (ETH)
// session. Sizes in MNQ ($2/pt). Same trading logic as onr_book.pine: only "LUCID EVAL: consistency rule you bought"
// defaults to the 50% add-on, and the Lucid backtest text below leads with the add-on's figures.
// ACCOUNT: Lucid Flex 25K / 50K / 100K / 150K or Topstep 25K / 50K / 100K / 150K (inputs "Prop firm" and "Account size",
//          default Topstep 50K; TOPSTEP below). The $ amounts below are for 25K; every one scales
//          with the account's max loss (x2 at 50K, x3 at 100K, x4.5 at 150K). Target, qualifying day and payout cap
//          follow the firm's table. At Lucid 50K: stop <= $1,200, eval target <= $1,500 with the add-on, day budget $1,200,
//          qualifying day $150, payout cap $2,000.
// EVAL   : ONE bracket trade per day, first trigger that fires:
//            1) overnight reversion at 18:10 on signal nights (exit 09:30); skipped into Thursday / first-Friday 08:30 news
//            2) else the 09:35 opening drive (first 5 min >= 0.10 ADR, exit 16:00); not on half days (13:00 ET halt)
//          Stop <= $600 INCLUDING commission, target <= 50% of the profit target with the add-on and at Topstep (40% without),
//          contracts = round(($stop + $target) / (width x ADR x $2)).
// FUNDED : trades in priority order under a day risk budget = min($600, cushion - $10), N MNQ per leg:
//            1) overnight reversion 18:10 -> 09:30, stop 0.5 ADR, no target
//            2) opening-drive pyramid 09:35: stop 0.35 ADR, add N at +0.15 ADR (stop -> breakeven), trail 0.25 ADR, exit 16:00
//            3) v2.7: 5-minute ORB 09:35 (input "FUNDED: 5-minute ORB leg"; Auto = Topstep 50K and 150K only): in the
//               direction of the first 5 minutes when that move is >= 0.05 ADR, stop 0.10 ADR, target 1 ADR, exit 16:00.
//               It always faces the pyramid's way (the same 5 minutes; the pyramid needs >= 0.10 ADR)
//            4) initial-balance breakout: stop order 1 tick beyond the 09:30-10:30 range, live 10:30-13:00, stop 0.25 /
//               target 0.5 ADR; on a 09:35-drive day only on the drive's side (else both sides, OCO). While an ORB
//               trade is open, the IB side against it waits: placed once that trade closes, or cancelled for the day
//               if the price reaches it first (an IB fill never opposes the ORB trade)
//          No 09:35 / 10:30 entries on US holiday half-sessions and early closes. Good Friday has no session, except
//          when the jobs report falls on it (2021, 2023 and 2026 in your file; next in 2034): CME then halts at 09:15
//          ET, before the 09:30 exit, so close an overnight trade by 09:10 ET (panel; alert at 09:05). The backtest
//          exits it at 09:15, the session's last bar.
//          N ("Auto", default) = round(350 / ADR) per $1,000 of max loss. At 50K that is round(700 / ADR): 1 MNQ above a
//          467-point range, 2 MNQ at 280-467, 3 MNQ at 200-280, more below 200 (cap by size: Lucid 10 / 20 / 30 / 40 MNQ,
//          Topstep 6 / 10 / 10). When eligible (Lucid: 5 qualifying days; P&L >= $1,000 at every size, and up since the
//          last payout) request the MAXIMUM allowed: 50% of profit up to the size's cap. Abandon the account if the
//          cushion falls below $200. LUCID: CLOSE it right after its 4th payout (input "LUCID FUNDED: payout plan"):
//          after a 5th payout Lucid moves you to a live account and closes every sim account, funded and evals.
// LIVE   : a LucidLive account (Phase LIVE) trades the FUNDED plan exactly. Its drawdown, the size's max loss (50K:
//          $2,000), trails the end-of-day P&L from $0 and locks at +$100 once live profit reaches it; no consistency
//          rule, payouts any day. Withdraw nothing before the lock (a payout locks it at once), then everything above
//          the max loss + $100, keeping that cushion. Stop trading it below a $200 cushion; once no live account is
//          left, Lucid lets you buy evals again after 2 weeks. Lucid only: a Topstep live account is not modelled.
// TOPSTEP: input "Prop firm" = Topstep. Trading Combine = Phase EVAL, Express Funded Account (XFA) = Phase FUNDED. At
//          50K / 100K / 150K the trades and every $ limit are the same as at Lucid (the same profit target and max
//          loss); 25K differs (below). What changes, exactly as in the backtests (backtest/onr/topstep_sim.py and
//          topstep25k.py; Topstep's help centre, read Nov 20 2026):
//          - 50K / 100K / 150K: the max loss stops trailing at the start balance ($0; Lucid +$100), and in an XFA it is
//            $0 after any payout;
//          - Combine: each day's target is capped at 50% of the profit target (the add-on setting; nothing to buy at
//            Topstep); it passes at the target with the best day <= 55% of the profit; at most 50 / 100 / 150 MNQ;
//          - XFA, Standard payouts (recommended): 5 winning days of $150 or more at every size, then 50% of the
//            balance up to $2,000 / $3,000 / $5,000. Consistency payouts: 3 traded days with no day above 40% of the
//            profit since the last payout, then 50% of the balance up to $3,000 / $4,000 / $6,000. The panel asks for a
//            payout once the XFA is $1,000 up and up since the last payout, as at Lucid;
//          - no payout limit: an XFA trades until it fails;
//          - funded legs at most 6 / 10 / 10 MNQ: the backtest's assumption for Topstep's Scaling Plan, whose table could
//            not be read. Check your XFA's limit: one direction can hold up to 3 N at once (pyramid 2 N + IB N), 4 N with
//            the ORB leg; the panel shows it.
//          - 25K is Topstep's "Labs $25K Static" account: $2,000 target; a STATIC $1,000 max loss (it never trails; $0
//            after the first XFA payout); a $500 daily loss limit in the Combine and the XFA, which the plan meets by
//            capping each day's risk at $500 (the eval stop, commission included, and the funded day budget; $600
//            otherwise at 25K); at most 20 MNQ (funded legs at most 6); XFA payout cap $4,000 on either path. The
//            Combine costs $75 once, expires 90 days after purchase and cannot be reset; up to 5 can be bought a month.
//          Topstep may call a trader up to a live account at its discretion, which closes every XFA: not modelled.
//          BACKTEST on your MNQ file, the last 5 years (Nov 15 2021 - Nov 20 2026), 5 XFAs + 5 Combines, Standard
//          payouts, No Activation Fee path: about $73.1k a year at 50K (worst full year +$47.5k), $122.1k at 100K
//          (+$94.9k), $136.0k at 150K (+$41.1k); Consistency payouts $42.6k / $58.7k / $84.3k. A best case: the
//          call-up to live is not in it. 25K ($75 Combines, at most 5 a month): Standard payouts $32.2k a year (worst
//          full year +$10.1k), Consistency $32.2k (+$6.9k); Lucid 25K with the add-on made $31.1k (+$18.1k).
//          v2.7 ORB LEG (round 7 of the research: 13 published strategy families, 1,556 settings, picked on 2019-2022
//          and judged once on 2023-2026; the 5-minute ORB passed), the same test, net a year without -> with it: 50K
//          $73.1k -> $90.5k (worst full year +$47.5k -> +$43.3k; 2023-26 $76.6k -> $98.1k; 1 tick of slippage on
//          every fill $67.9k -> $89.9k); 150K $136.0k -> $185.4k (1 tick $135.6k -> $189.9k; its worst full year
//          swings between runs: +$41.1k -> +$140.3k, at 1 tick +$38.4k -> +$37.5k). Auto leaves it off elsewhere:
//          25K $32.2k -> $35.8k but $31.3k -> $30.6k at 1 tick; 100K $122.1k -> $141.4k but its worst full year
//          +$94.9k -> +$59.4k; Lucid 50K $55.7k -> $55.2k (40% rule; 2023-26 $60.7k -> $49.9k), $58.3k -> $62.3k with
//          the add-on. backtest/onr/r7_accounts.py and r7_v27.py.
// ADR = average 09:30-16:00 NQ range of the last 14 full sessions.
// CHART  : every trade is drawn like TradingView's position tool, from its entry bar to its exit bar: red box = entry to
//          stop, green box = entry to target, gray line = entry. A BUY / SELL label marks each entry and a label with
//          the result in $ (commission included) marks each exit; trades acting on the same bar share one label, one
//          line each (an exit label is coloured by their total). Hover a label for the prices. Trades with no fixed
//          target (funded overnight trade, pyramid) have no green box; the pyramid's moving stop is the orange line and
//          its add is marked ADD. Purple lines = IB stop orders waiting to fill; a gray line = an IB side held
//          back while an ORB trade is open.
// SEVERAL ACCOUNTS: one copy of this indicator per account (its own inputs). All copies always hold the same direction,
//          so copy-trading never creates opposing positions across accounts (Lucid prohibits that). One exception: a
//          copy running the ORB leg and one without it can face opposite ways on a rare day (an IB fill against an
//          open ORB trade: 1 day in the last 5 years of your file). Auto keeps the leg off at Lucid, so Lucid copies on
//          Auto always agree. Lucid allows 10 accounts per household, at most 5 of them funded: keep the 5 funded
//          slots full from 5 evals behind them. Topstep allows up to 5 XFAs at once: the same plan, 5 XFAs with 5
//          Combines behind them.
// YOUR PLAN (v2.6.6; backtest/onr/plan_search.py, 31 ways of running the accounts tested from 48 start dates): Topstep
//          50K, 5 XFAs + 5 Combines from day one (No Activation Fee path, Standard payouts). Every payout stays in the
//          business, 30% set aside for tax. At $11,000 of spare cash add Lucid 50K with the add-on (5 funded + 5 evals).
//          At $25,000 each new Topstep Combine is 150K while NQ's 14-day range is at least 151 points, else 50K: below
//          151 a 150K XFA's 10-MNQ leg cap binds and it trades no more than a 100K. The input "PLAN: my spare cash has
//          reached $25,000" and the panel line "Next Topstep Combine" say which size to buy. Backtest on your MNQ file,
//          48 start dates from Dec 2019 to Nov 2023: a typical start made about $259k in 3 years (worst start $168k),
//          after every fee and the 30% tax set-aside. The $15,000 car fits at $51,000 of spare cash. These plan
//          figures are v2.6.6's, without the v2.7 ORB leg (the plan was not re-run with it).
// LUCID BACKTEST at 50K on your MNQ file, the last 5 years (Nov 15 2021 - Nov 20 2026; 5-minute bars, as recorded),
//          $1.00 commission, after Lucid's 10%, evals at $98.20 with the add-on (a discount-code price of $88.20 plus the
//          add-on's $10; $88.20 with the 40% rule): 43.2% of evals pass with the add-on (43.4% with the 40% rule) and the
//          first payout comes a median 53 days after the first eval (58). 5 funded + 5 evals, each account closed after
//          its 4th payout: about $58.3k a year ($55.7k with the 40% rule), every full year positive, worst 12 months
//          +$26.0k (+$22.8k), longest payout wait 6.1 months (6.4). Taking 5th payouts and going live instead: $65.2k a
//          year, more but with a weaker worst full year ($52.3k with the 40% rule, less than closing; going
//          live rests on this backtest's simple model of a live account); the live accounts mostly closed
//          within about two weeks, and each move cost the evals in reserve. Lucid's risk team decides who goes live and
//          may move a trader for other reasons, such as total payouts. Over the last 5 years the add-on paid for itself: $2.6k
//          a year more than the 40% rule, inside the noise (it pays for itself up to $36.17 an eval). From Dec 2019
//          to Nov 2021 it made $6.8k a year less, beyond that window's noise, so it fails the research's pre-registered rule 5Y.
//          The last 53 sessions of your file, Sep 9 - Nov 20 2026 (far too short to prove anything): 33 of 50 finished
//          evals passed (40% rule: 34 of 51), and one funded 50K account made +$16.9k from 78 trades either way.
//          NOT live-tested; past results do not guarantee future payouts. Full study: backtest/onr in the MMT repo.
// =====================================================================================================================

grpA = "Account - update before each session"
firm = input.string("Topstep", "Prop firm", options = ["Topstep", "Lucid Flex"], group = grpA, tooltip = "Topstep: Trading Combine = Phase EVAL, Express Funded Account (XFA) = Phase FUNDED; 25K (Topstep Labs $25K Static: a static $1,000 max loss and a $500 daily loss limit) / 50K / 100K / 150K. Sets Topstep's rules as the backtests used them: the max loss stops trailing at the start balance ($0) and is $0 in an XFA after any payout; the Combine passes at the target with the best day <= 55% (the plan caps each day at 50%) and holds at most 50 / 100 / 150 MNQ; the XFA payout path's rules and caps; no payout limit; at most 6 / 10 / 10 MNQ per funded leg (the backtest's Scaling Plan assumption: check your XFA's limit). Lucid Flex: Lucid's rules. Backtest on your MNQ file, last 5 years, 5 funded + 5 evals: Topstep 50K with Standard payouts (No Activation Fee path) ~$73.1k a year vs ~$58.3k for Lucid 50K with the add-on, each account closed after its 4th payout. Topstep's discretionary call-up to a live account (it closes every XFA) is not modelled, so its figure is a best case.")
phase = input.string("EVAL", "Phase", options = ["EVAL", "FUNDED", "LIVE"], group = grpA, tooltip = "EVAL: an evaluation (one bracket trade a day); at Topstep, a Trading Combine. FUNDED: a sim-funded account (the 3-trade book; 4 with the v2.7 ORB leg); at Topstep, an Express Funded Account (XFA). LIVE: a LucidLive account, after Lucid moves you live: it trades exactly the FUNDED plan; only the drawdown and payout guidance differ. Lucid only: a Topstep live account is not modelled.")
acctSize = input.string("50K", "Account size", options = ["25K", "50K", "100K", "150K"], group = grpA, tooltip = "Sets the firm's target, max loss, qualifying-day amount, payout cap and position limits for that size (Topstep 25K = the Labs $25K Static account: $2,000 target, a static $1,000 max loss, a $500 daily loss limit, 20 MNQ, payout cap $4,000), and scales every $ limit of the plan (stop cap, day budget, cushion levels, funded size) by max loss / $1,000. Backtest on your MNQ file, last 5 years, 5 funded + 5 evals with the add-on, each closed after its 4th payout: Lucid 25K ~$31.1k a year, 50K ~$58.3k, 100K ~$71.6k, 150K ~$97.1k (100K and 150K at assumed prices), worst 12 months +$7.9k / +$26.0k / +$18.8k / +$26.1k; Topstep with Standard payouts (No Activation Fee path): 25K Static ~$32.2k, 50K ~$73.1k, 100K ~$122.1k, 150K ~$136.0k.")
pnlNow = input.float(0.0, "P&L now ($ vs account start; funded / live: after payouts)", group = grpA)
peakEod = input.float(0.0, "Highest end-of-day P&L so far ($)", minval = 0.0, group = grpA)
bestDay = input.float(0.0, "Best day so far ($): EVAL since the start; Topstep Consistency XFA since the last payout", minval = 0.0, group = grpA, tooltip = "EVAL (a Lucid eval or a Topstep Combine): your best day since the account started; it sets the profit you need. FUNDED at Topstep on the Consistency payout path: your best day since the last payout (since the start before the first): no day may be above 40% of the profit since then. Not used otherwise.")
consOpt = input.string("50% (paid add-on)", "LUCID EVAL: consistency rule you bought", options = ["40% (standard)", "50% (paid add-on)"], group = grpA, tooltip = "Lucid only (at Topstep the Combine plan always caps a day at 50%, inside Topstep's 55% best-day rule). This edition defaults to the 50% add-on: set it to what you actually bought at checkout (it applies to the eval only). With 50% the eval passes when the best day is <= 50% of the profit, and the bracket's target cap is 50% of the profit target ($1,500 at 50K). Backtest on your MNQ file, last 5 years: 43.2% of evals passed with the add-on vs 43.4% (an eval started every session), and the first payout came a median 53 days after the first eval vs 58. Income: 5 funded + 5 evals closing each account after its 4th payout made $58,262 a year with the add-on at $98.20 an eval vs $55,669 at $88.20 ($59,253 with the add-on before its own $10; it pays for itself up to $36.17 an eval); taking 5th payouts and going live, $65,175 vs $52,260. From Dec 2019 to Nov 2021 it made $6,757 a year less than the 40% rule, beyond that window's noise, so it fails the research's pre-registered rule 5Y. Over the last 5 years its worst full year is clearly better, but the money it adds ($2,593 a year) is inside the noise ($3,040).")
widthOpt = input.string("Wide x1.0 (recommended)", "EVAL: bracket width", options = ["Wide x1.0 (recommended)", "Medium x0.75", "Tight x0.5 (old)"], group = grpA, tooltip = "Wide = fewer contracts with a wider stop and target (at a 650-point range: 2 MNQ at 50K, 1 at 25K, stop ~300 pts). Backtest pass rate at 50K on your MNQ file with the 40% rule (not re-run with the add-on), last 5 years: wide 43.4%, medium 41.4%, tight 38.2%; since Dec 2019: 41.6%, 37.5%, 38.4% (in Dec 2019 - Nov 2021 alone tight did best: 38.9% vs 36.9% wide).")
newsSkip = input.bool(true, "EVAL: no overnight trade into Thursday / first-Friday 08:30 news", group = grpA, tooltip = "Skips the 18:10 overnight eval trade on Wednesday evenings (jobless claims Thursday 08:30) and on the evening before the first Friday of the month (jobs report; the release occasionally falls on another day). The 09:35 opening drive can still trade that day. Eval only. Backtest at 50K on your MNQ file with the 40% rule (not re-run with the add-on): pass rate 43.4% with the skip vs 43.2% without over the last 5 years, 41.6% vs 42.0% since Dec 2019 and 36.9% vs 38.7% in Dec 2019 - Nov 2021: no real gain on your file, the differences are small and go both ways; the skip is kept as a risk rule (no overnight eval trade into the 08:30 news).")
nPay = input.int(0, "Payouts taken on this account", minval = 0, maxval = 99, group = grpA, tooltip = "FUNDED: payouts taken so far. Lucid: with the default payout plan the account is closed after its 4th. Topstep: no limit; after any payout the XFA's max loss is $0. LIVE (Lucid): enter 1 once you have taken any live payout: that locks a live account's drawdown at +$100.")
qDays = input.int(0, "FUNDED: qualifying days since last payout (Lucid >= $100 / $150 / $200 / $250 by size; Topstep: see tooltip)", minval = 0, group = grpA, tooltip = "Days since the last payout (since the start before the first) that count. Lucid: days of at least $100 / $150 / $200 / $250 at 25K / 50K / 100K / 150K, 5 needed. Topstep Standard payouts: winning days of $150 or more at every size, 5 needed. Topstep Consistency payouts: every day you traded, 3 needed.")
pnlAfterPay = input.float(0.0, "FUNDED: P&L right after your last payout ($; 0 before the first)", group = grpA, tooltip = "The panel asks for a payout only when the account is up since the last payout (Lucid's rule; the Topstep backtest used it too, and Topstep's Consistency path measures its 40% from here). Enter the P&L your account showed right after the last payout was taken.")
payPlan = input.string("Close after the 4th payout (recommended)", "LUCID FUNDED: payout plan", options = ["Close after the 4th payout (recommended)", "Take the 5th payout (Lucid moves you live)"], group = grpA, tooltip = "Lucid only; Topstep has no payout limit. Lucid: a Flex account can take up to 5 payouts, after which the trader is moved to a live account and EVERY sim account (funded and evals) is closed. Backtest on your MNQ file, last 5 years, 5 funded + 5 evals at $88.20 ($98.20 with the add-on's $10): closing each funded account right after its 4th payout (a passed eval takes its slot) made $55,669 a year with the 40% rule and $58,262 with the 50% add-on; taking the 5th payout and going live made $52,260 and $65,175. With the 40% rule going live made less: the live accounts mostly closed within about two weeks and each move cost the evals in reserve. With the add-on it made more, but with a weaker worst full year ($37,731 vs $40,987), and that result rests on this backtest's simple model of a live account. Lucid's risk team decides who goes live and may move a trader for other reasons, such as total payouts.")
tsPath = input.string("Standard (recommended)", "TOPSTEP FUNDED: XFA payout path", options = ["Standard (recommended)", "Consistency"], group = grpA, tooltip = "Pick the path you chose when you activated this XFA. Standard: 5 winning days of $150 or more since the last payout, then up to 50% of the balance, cap $2,000 / $3,000 / $5,000 at 50K / 100K / 150K. Consistency: 3 traded days with no day above 40% of the profit since the last payout, cap $3,000 / $4,000 / $6,000. Backtest on your MNQ file, last 5 years, 5 XFAs + 5 Combines (No Activation Fee path): Standard ~$73.1k / $122.1k / $136.0k a year, Consistency ~$42.6k / $58.7k / $84.3k: its 40% rule holds payouts back for months.")
plan150 = input.bool(false, "PLAN: my spare cash has reached $25,000 (150K step)", group = grpA, tooltip = "Your plan (backtest/onr/plan_search.py): Topstep 50K, 5 XFAs + 5 Combines from day one; Lucid 50K with the add-on once your spare cash (business cash after setting aside 30% of each payout for tax) reaches $11,000; from $25,000, each new Topstep Combine is 150K while NQ's 14-day range (the NQ ADR line) is at least 151 points, else 50K. Below 151 points a 150K XFA's legs are capped at 10 MNQ, so it trades no more than a 100K. Tick this once you reach $25,000: the panel line 'Next Topstep Combine' then says which size to buy. Accounts already open keep their size; set Account size to each account's own size.")
commIn = input.float(1.00, "Commission per MNQ round turn ($)", minval = 0.0, step = 0.01, group = grpA, tooltip = "Cost per micro contract, in and out: yours is $0.50 to enter + $0.50 to exit = $1.00 a round turn, and every backtest figure quoted here uses $1.00. Used for the eval stop (a full stop-out, commission included, stays inside the $ limit) and for the simulated trade list.")
fundSize = input.string("Auto (ADR-normalised)", "FUNDED: contracts per leg", options = ["Auto (ADR-normalised)", "Fixed 1 MNQ (v1)"], group = grpA, tooltip = "Auto = round(350 / ADR) MNQ per $1,000 of max loss. At 50K that is round(700 / ADR): 1 MNQ while NQ's daily range is above 467 points, 2 MNQ at 280-467, 3 MNQ at 200-280 and more below that (at most 10 / 20 / 30 / 40 MNQ for 25K / 50K / 100K / 150K at Lucid; 6 / 10 / 10 at Topstep 50K / 100K / 150K, the backtest's Scaling Plan assumption). Fixed 1 MNQ is v1's sizing, which stalled payouts in low-range years.")
orbOpt = input.string("Auto (Topstep 50K / 150K)", "FUNDED: 5-minute ORB leg (v2.7)", options = ["Auto (Topstep 50K / 150K)", "On (every funded account)", "Off (the v2.6.6 book)"], group = grpA, tooltip = "v2.7: a 4th funded leg from round 7 of the research (13 published strategy families, 1,556 settings, picked on 2019-2022 and judged once on 2023-2026). At 09:35 ET, if the first 5 minutes (09:30-09:35) moved at least 0.05 ADR: N MNQ in that direction, stop 0.10 ADR, target 1 ADR (10x the risk), exit 16:00. It is taken after the pyramid, inside the day budget, and always faces the pyramid's way (the pyramid needs the same move to be at least 0.10 ADR). While it is open, the IB's other side waits. Not on half days; never in an eval. Auto: on for Topstep 50K and 150K XFAs only. Backtest on your MNQ file, last 5 years, 5 XFAs + 5 Combines (Standard payouts, No Activation Fee path), net a year without -> with it: 50K $73.1k -> $90.5k (worst full year +$47.5k -> +$43.3k; 2023-26 $76.6k -> $98.1k; at 1 tick of slippage on every fill $67.9k -> $89.9k); 150K $136.0k -> $185.4k (1 tick $135.6k -> $189.9k). Left off by Auto: Topstep 25K $32.2k -> $35.8k but $31.3k -> $30.6k at 1 tick; 100K $122.1k -> $141.4k but its worst full year +$94.9k -> +$59.4k; Lucid 50K (5 funded + 5 evals) 40% rule $55.7k -> $55.2k (2023-26 $60.7k -> $49.9k), add-on $58.3k -> $62.3k. On = every funded and live account; Off = the v2.6.6 book.")
grpL = "Live tracking (alarm levels) - update each weekend"
liveDays = input.int(0, "Trading days since this funded account started trading ONR", minval = 0, group = grpL)
livePnl = input.float(0.0, "Live ONR trade P&L since then ($, this one funded account)", group = grpL, tooltip = "Sum of this funded account's ONR trade results since it started (no eval fees, no payouts). The bands come from the backtest: one 50K funded account (scaled to your size), Nov 2021 - Nov 2026 on your MNQ file, 20,000 bootstrap paths - median, 5th percentile (yellow) and 1st percentile (red). With the v2.7 ORB leg on, the bands come from the same test with it.")
grpD = "Data"
sigSym = input.symbol("OANDA:SPX500USD", "S&P 500 CFD for the stretch score (the research used an S&P 500 CFD)", group = grpD)
grpV = "Display"
showPanel = input.bool(true, "Show panel", group = grpV)
showBoxes = input.bool(true, "Show stop / target boxes", group = grpV, tooltip = "Each trade is drawn like TradingView's position tool, from its entry bar to its exit bar: red box = entry to stop, green box = entry to target, gray line = entry. Trades with no fixed target (the funded overnight trade and the pyramid) show only the red box; the pyramid's moving stop is the orange line.")
showLevels = input.bool(true, "Show trade labels", group = grpV, tooltip = "A BUY / SELL label at each entry (with the contracts) and the result in $ at each exit, commission included. Trades acting on the same bar share one label, one line each. Hover a label for the prices.")
showLog = input.bool(true, "Show the last 30 trades", group = grpV)
logPos = input.string("Bottom left", "Trade list position", options = ["Bottom left", "Bottom right", "Top left", "Middle left"], group = grpV)

// ---------- constants (fixed from research; S&P 500 2011-2026)
float PV = 2.0
float TK = 0.25
float COMM = commIn   // $ per MNQ round turn
float THR = 0.7187
float ADRREF = 350.0  // funded Auto size = round(ADRREF x M / ADR) MNQ
// The firm's rules by size: Lucid Flex (help centre, Nov 2026) or Topstep (help centre, read Nov 20 2026; 25K is the Labs
// $25K Static account). M scales every $ limit of the plan with the max loss.
bool TS = firm == "Topstep"
bool TSCONS = TS and tsPath == "Consistency"   // Topstep XFA payout path: Consistency (else Standard)
bool TSLAB = TS and acctSize == "25K"   // Topstep Labs $25K Static: static max loss, $500 daily loss limit
float TARGET = TSLAB ? 2000.0 : acctSize == "50K" ? 3000.0 : acctSize == "100K" ? 6000.0 : acctSize == "150K" ? 9000.0 : 1250.0
float MLL = acctSize == "50K" ? 2000.0 : acctSize == "100K" ? 3000.0 : acctSize == "150K" ? 4500.0 : 1000.0
float QDAY = TS ? 150.0 : acctSize == "50K" ? 150.0 : acctSize == "100K" ? 200.0 : acctSize == "150K" ? 250.0 : 100.0
float PAYCAP = TSLAB ? 4000.0 : TS ? (TSCONS ? (acctSize == "100K" ? 4000.0 : acctSize == "150K" ? 6000.0 : 3000.0) : (acctSize == "100K" ? 3000.0 : acctSize == "150K" ? 5000.0 : 2000.0)) : (acctSize == "50K" ? 2000.0 : acctSize == "100K" ? 2500.0 : acctSize == "150K" ? 3000.0 : 1000.0)
int EVALMAX = TS ? (acctSize == "25K" ? 20 : acctSize == "100K" ? 100 : acctSize == "150K" ? 150 : 50) : (acctSize == "50K" ? 40 : acctSize == "100K" ? 60 : acctSize == "150K" ? 100 : 20)
int FUNDMAX = TS ? (acctSize == "100K" or acctSize == "150K" ? 10 : 6) : (acctSize == "50K" ? 20 : acctSize == "100K" ? 30 : acctSize == "150K" ? 40 : 10)
float LOCK = TS ? 0.0 : 100.0   // where the trailing max loss stops: Topstep at the start balance, Lucid at +$100
float M = MLL / 1000.0
float DAYCAP = TSLAB ? 500.0 : 600.0 * M   // the day's risk cap: Topstep 25K's $500 daily loss limit, else $600 per $1,000 of max loss
string TZ = "America/New_York"
float CONS = TS ? 0.5 : (consOpt == "50% (paid add-on)" ? 0.5 : 0.4)   // the plan keeps the eval's best day <= CONS x the profit
float PASSCONS = TS ? 0.55 : CONS                                     // the firm's best-day rule at the pass (Topstep 55%)
float TPCAP = TARGET * CONS                                    // eval target cap per day (25K: $500 at 40%, $625 at 50%; 50K: $1,200 / $1,500)
float SPAN = widthOpt == "Tight x0.5 (old)" ? 0.5 : (widthOpt == "Medium x0.75" ? 0.75 : 1.0)   // eval bracket width (stop + target) in ADRs
int PAYMAX = TS ? 1000000 : (payPlan == "Take the 5th payout (Lucid moves you live)" ? 5 : 4)   // Lucid: payouts before a funded account is closed (4) or moved live (5); Topstep: no limit
// v2.7 5-minute ORB leg (funded / live only): Auto = Topstep 50K and 150K, the sizes where its gain passed rule 5Y and
// survived 1 tick of slippage (backtest/onr/results_r7/v27_topstep_sizes.csv)
bool ORBON = orbOpt == "On (every funded account)" or (orbOpt == "Auto (Topstep 50K / 150K)" and TS and (acctSize == "50K" or acctSize == "150K"))

// ---------- trade log (last 30 closed trades)
type Trade
    int t
    int tx
    string nm
    int sd
    float ent
    float ex
    float usd
    float r
    string why
var array<Trade> LOG = array.new<Trade>()
f_log(array<Trade> lg, int t0, int tx, string nm, int sd, float ent, float ex, float usd, float r, string why) =>
    array.push(lg, Trade.new(t0, tx, nm, sd, ent, ex, usd, r, why))
    if array.size(lg) > 30
        array.shift(lg)
    0

// ---------- session clock: minutes since 18:00 ET
int tfMin = timeframe.isminutes ? timeframe.multiplier : 0
int sStart = ((hour(time, TZ) * 60 + minute(time, TZ)) - 1080 + 1440) % 1440
int sEnd = sStart + tfMin
bool newDay = na(sStart[1]) or sStart < sStart[1]
f_hit(int m) =>
    sEnd >= m and (newDay or sEnd[1] < m)
bool evON = f_hit(10)
bool evONx = f_hit(930)
bool evOD = f_hit(935)
bool evIB = f_hit(990)
bool evIBend = f_hit(1140)
bool evEOD = f_hit(1320)
bool evEarly = f_hit(1135)
bool evGF = f_hit(905)   // 09:05: Good Friday warning (that session halts at 09:15)
bool isRth = sStart >= 930 and sStart < 1320
var int onBars = 0
if sStart < 900
    onBars += 1

// ---------- US holiday half-sessions and early closes, by rule: CME equity futures stop around 13:00-13:15 ET on
// MLK, Presidents, Memorial, Juneteenth, Independence and Labor Day, Thanksgiving, the day after, Christmas Eve and July 3.
f_nthDow(int y, int m, int dw, int nth) =>
    int d1 = dayofweek(timestamp(TZ, y, m, 1, 12, 0), TZ)
    1 + (dw - d1 + 7) % 7 + 7 * (nth - 1)
f_lastDow(int y, int m, int dw) =>
    int tl = (m == 12 ? timestamp(TZ, y + 1, 1, 1, 12, 0) : timestamp(TZ, y, m + 1, 1, 12, 0)) - 86400000
    dayofmonth(tl, TZ) - (dayofweek(tl, TZ) - dw + 7) % 7
f_obs(int y, int m, int d) =>
    int w = dayofweek(timestamp(TZ, y, m, d, 12, 0), TZ)
    w == dayofweek.saturday ? d - 1 : (w == dayofweek.sunday ? d + 1 : d)
f_halfDay(int t) =>
    int y = year(t, TZ)
    int m = month(t, TZ)
    int d = dayofmonth(t, TZ)
    int w = dayofweek(t, TZ)
    bool wk = w != dayofweek.saturday and w != dayofweek.sunday
    int tg = f_nthDow(y, 11, dayofweek.thursday, 4)
    bool hol = (m == 1 and d == f_nthDow(y, 1, dayofweek.monday, 3)) or (m == 2 and d == f_nthDow(y, 2, dayofweek.monday, 3)) or (m == 5 and d == f_lastDow(y, 5, dayofweek.monday)) or (m == 6 and y >= 2022 and d == f_obs(y, 6, 19)) or (m == 7 and d == f_obs(y, 7, 4)) or (m == 9 and d == f_nthDow(y, 9, dayofweek.monday, 1)) or (m == 11 and d == tg)
    bool early = (m == 11 and d == tg + 1) or (m == 12 and d == 24 and wk and f_obs(y, 12, 25) != 24) or (m == 7 and d == 3 and wk and f_obs(y, 7, 4) != 3)
    hol or early
// Good Friday = Easter Sunday - 2 days (Gregorian computus). CME equity futures are closed then, except when the jobs
// report falls on it (2021, 2023 and 2026 in your file): that session halts at 09:15 ET, before the 09:30 exit.
f_goodFri(int t) =>
    int y = year(t, TZ)
    int a = y % 19
    int b = math.floor(y / 100.0)
    int c = y % 100
    int h = (19 * a + b - math.floor(b / 4.0) - math.floor((b - math.floor((b + 8) / 25.0) + 1) / 3.0) + 15) % 30
    int lw = (32 + 2 * (b % 4) + 2 * math.floor(c / 4.0) - h - c % 4) % 7
    int mq = math.floor((a + 11 * h + 22 * lw) / 451.0)
    int q = h + lw - 7 * mq + 114
    int gf = timestamp(TZ, y, math.floor(q / 31.0), q % 31 + 1, 12, 0) - 2 * 86400000
    month(t, TZ) == month(gf, TZ) and dayofmonth(t, TZ) == dayofmonth(gf, TZ)
var bool halfDay = false
var bool goodFri = false
var int halfEnd = 0   // when a shortened session halts: 13:00 ET on half days, 09:15 ET on Good Friday
if newDay
    // the session's calendar day = the day 6 hours after the 18:00 open (same rule as the research)
    int t6 = time + 6 * 3600000
    halfDay := f_halfDay(t6)
    goodFri := f_goodFri(t6)
    halfEnd := timestamp(TZ, year(t6, TZ), month(t6, TZ), dayofmonth(t6, TZ), goodFri ? 9 : 13, goodFri ? 15 : 0)

// ---------- NQ RTH range and ADR14
var float rHi = na
var float rLo = na
var float rOpen = na
var float ibH = na
var float ibL = na
var int rthN = 0
var array<float> rngs = array.new<float>()
bool rthFirst = isRth and not isRth[1]
bool rthDone = not isRth and isRth[1]
if rthFirst
    rHi := high
    rLo := low
    rOpen := open
    ibH := high
    ibL := low
    rthN := 1
else if isRth
    rHi := math.max(rHi, high)
    rLo := math.min(rLo, low)
    rthN += 1
    if sStart < 990
        ibH := math.max(ibH, high)
        ibL := math.min(ibL, low)
if rthDone and not na(rHi) and rthN * tfMin >= 385
    array.push(rngs, rHi - rLo)
    if array.size(rngs) > 14
        array.shift(rngs)
// Same ADR from 30-minute bars: that feed's history reaches far before the chart's first bar, so trading (and the
// trade list) starts on the first chart day instead of after 14 warm-up sessions. 30-min bars tile 09:30-16:00 exactly.
f_adr30() =>
    int s0 = ((hour(time, TZ) * 60 + minute(time, TZ)) - 1080 + 1440) % 1440
    bool inR = s0 >= 930 and s0 < 1320
    var float hi = na
    var float lo = na
    var bool was = false
    var int nb = 0
    var array<float> rr = array.new<float>()
    if inR and not was
        hi := high
        lo := low
        nb := 1
    else if inR
        hi := math.max(hi, high)
        lo := math.min(lo, low)
        nb := nb + 1
    if was and not inR and not na(hi) and nb >= 13
        array.push(rr, hi - lo)
        if array.size(rr) > 14
            array.shift(rr)
    was := inR
    float a = array.size(rr) >= 14 ? array.avg(rr) : na
    a[1]
float adr30 = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "30", f_adr30(), lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_on)
float adr = not na(adr30) ? adr30 : (array.size(rngs) >= 14 ? array.avg(rngs) : na)

// ---------- S&P stretch score: RTH sessions (09:30-16:00) of an S&P 500 CFD built from 30-minute bars, features exactly as
// in the research (HistData SPXUSD, an S&P 500 CFD), full sessions only, fixed z constants. Final once the 16:00 bar closes.
// The 30-min feed's history reaches far before the chart's first bar. After a half session (holiday / early close) the
// last full session's score stays in force for the next evening, as in v1 and in the backtests (in the 2011-2026
// research those 62 of 1,303 overnight trades were fine).
f_mean(array<float> a, int k0, int k1) =>
    float s = 0.0
    for i = k0 to k1
        s := s + array.get(a, i)
    s / (k1 - k0 + 1)
f_hi(array<float> a, int k0, int k1) =>
    float m = array.get(a, k0)
    for i = k0 to k1
        m := math.max(m, array.get(a, i))
    m
f_clv(array<float> c, array<float> h, array<float> l, int k0, int k1) =>
    float s = 0.0
    for i = k0 to k1
        float rg = array.get(h, i) - array.get(l, i)
        s := s + (rg > 0 ? (array.get(c, i) - array.get(l, i)) / rg : 0.5)
    s / (k1 - k0 + 1)
f_score() =>
    int s0 = ((hour(time, TZ) * 60 + minute(time, TZ)) - 1080 + 1440) % 1440
    bool inR = s0 >= 930 and s0 < 1320
    var int prevS = -1
    var float onl = na
    var float onlR = na
    var float ro = na
    var float rh = na
    var float rl = na
    var float rc = na
    var int nb = 0
    var bool was = false
    var array<float> aC = array.new<float>()
    var array<float> aH = array.new<float>()
    var array<float> aL = array.new<float>()
    var array<float> aO = array.new<float>()
    var array<float> aN = array.new<float>()
    var float sc = na
    if prevS < 0 or s0 < prevS
        onl := low
    else if s0 < 930
        onl := na(onl) ? low : math.min(onl, low)
    if inR and not was
        ro := open
        rh := high
        rl := low
        nb := 1
        onlR := onl
    else if inR
        rh := math.max(rh, high)
        rl := math.min(rl, low)
        nb := nb + 1
    if inR
        rc := close
    if was and not inR and nb >= 13
        array.push(aC, rc)
        array.push(aH, rh)
        array.push(aL, rl)
        array.push(aO, ro)
        array.push(aN, onlR)
        if array.size(aC) > 70
            array.shift(aC)
            array.shift(aH)
            array.shift(aL)
            array.shift(aO)
            array.shift(aN)
        int n = array.size(aC)
        if n >= 61
            float rs = 0.0
            for i = n - 14 to n - 1
                rs := rs + array.get(aH, i) - array.get(aL, i)
            float a = rs / 14.0
            float c0 = array.get(aC, n - 1)
            int up = 0
            for i = n - 5 to n - 1
                if array.get(aC, i) > array.get(aC, i - 1)
                    up := up + 1
            float z = (-(c0 - f_mean(aC, n - 5, n - 1)) / a + 0.144803) / 0.992304
            z := z + (-(c0 - f_mean(aC, n - 10, n - 1)) / a + 0.366907) / 1.472484
            z := z + (-(c0 - f_mean(aC, n - 20, n - 1)) / a + 0.866958) / 2.110144
            z := z + (-(c0 - array.get(aC, n - 4)) / (a * math.sqrt(3.0)) + 0.126071) / 0.907152
            z := z + (-(c0 - array.get(aC, n - 6)) / (a * math.sqrt(5.0)) + 0.176010) / 0.876653
            z := z + (-(c0 - array.get(aC, n - 11)) / (a * math.sqrt(10.0)) + 0.283615) / 0.855161
            z := z + (-(c0 - f_hi(aC, n - 10, n - 1)) / a - 1.168381) / 1.361280
            z := z + (-(c0 - f_hi(aC, n - 20, n - 1)) / a - 1.551989) / 1.655467
            z := z + (-(c0 - f_hi(aC, n - 60, n - 1)) / a - 2.324757) / 2.348382
            z := z + (-(f_clv(aC, aH, aL, n - 3, n - 1) - 0.5) + 0.054304) / 0.178694
            z := z + (-(f_clv(aC, aH, aL, n - 5, n - 1) - 0.5) + 0.054296) / 0.137704
            z := z + (-(up / 5.0 - 0.5) + 0.045908) / 0.216550
            z := z + (-(array.get(aO, n - 1) - array.get(aC, n - 2)) / a + 0.064120) / 0.675399
            z := z + ((array.get(aN, n - 1) < array.get(aL, n - 2) ? 1.0 : 0.0) - 0.355450) / 0.478650
            sc := z / 14.0
    was := inR
    prevS := s0
    sc[1]
float score = request.security(sigSym, "30", f_score(), lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_on)
int sigSide = na(score) ? 0 : (score >= THR ? 1 : (score <= -THR ? -1 : 0))

// ---------- account math (from your inputs)
bool isEval = phase == "EVAL"
bool isLive = phase == "LIVE"
bool isFunded = phase == "FUNDED"
string FTAG = isLive ? "LIVE" : "FUNDED"
// a Lucid live account's drawdown trails from $0 and locks at +$100 once live profit reaches the max loss, or at its first payout
bool liveLocked = isLive and not TS and (nPay > 0 or peakEod >= MLL)
// eval / funded: the trailing max loss stops at LOCK (Lucid +$100, Topstep $0) once the end-of-day peak is the max loss
// above it, or after a payout (Topstep: an XFA's max loss is $0 after any payout; a Combine has no payouts).
// Topstep 25K (Labs Static): the max loss never trails: -$1,000 from the start, $0 after the first XFA payout.
float floorLvl = TSLAB ? ((nPay > 0 and not isEval) ? 0.0 : -MLL) : isLive and not TS ? (liveLocked ? 100.0 : peakEod - MLL) : (((nPay > 0 and not (TS and isEval)) or peakEod >= MLL + LOCK) ? LOCK : peakEod - MLL)
float cushion = pnlNow - floorLvl
float room = math.min(DAYCAP, cushion - 10.0 * M)
// the eval has passed once the profit reaches the target with the best day inside the firm's rule (Topstep 55%, Lucid the
// consistency rule you bought): no new eval trades from then on, as in the backtest, whose eval stops at the pass
float evalNeed = math.max(TARGET, bestDay / PASSCONS) - pnlNow
bool evalDone = isEval and evalNeed <= 0.0
string DONETXT = "the profit target is reached - set Phase to FUNDED once " + (TS ? "Topstep" : "Lucid") + " confirms the pass"
bool fundAuto = fundSize == "Auto (ADR-normalised)"
int nF = fundAuto and not na(adr) ? int(math.max(1, math.min(FUNDMAX, math.round(ADRREF * M / adr)))) : 1
f_bracket(float a) =>
    float sl = math.min(DAYCAP, cushion - 5.0 * M)
    float need = math.max(TARGET, bestDay / CONS)
    float tp = math.max(20.0 * M, math.min(TPCAP, math.max(need - pnlNow, 0.0) + 15.0 * M))
    int n = int(math.max(1.0, math.min(EVALMAX, math.round((sl + tp) / (SPAN * a * PV)))))
    // the stop distance leaves room for the round-turn commission, so a full stop-out costs at most $sl
    [n, (sl - n * COMM) / (n * PV), tp / (n * PV)]

// ---------- trade state (what the plan says to hold; estimated with bar highs/lows)
var float usedRisk = 0.0
var bool evalUsedToday = false
var float ibReserve = 0.0
// eval single trade
var int eSide = 0
var int eN = 0
var float eEnt = na
var float eStp = na
var float eTgt = na
var int eExit = 0
var string eName = ""
// funded overnight
var int oSide = 0
var int oN = 1
var float oEnt = na
var float oStp = na
// funded pyramid (pN contracts per unit, pNu units)
var int pSide = 0
var int pN = 1
var float pE1 = na
var float pE2 = na
var int pNu = 0
var float pStp = na
var float pBest = na
var float pA = na
// funded IB
var bool ibArmed = false
var float ibBuy = na
var float ibSell = na
var int iSide = 0
var int iN = 1
var float iEnt = na
var float iStp = na
var float iTgt = na
var int odToday = 0   // today's 09:35 drive direction (0 = none); the IB order only trades with it
// funded 5-minute ORB (v2.7)
var int orbSide = 0
var int orbN = 1
var float orbEnt = na
var float orbStp = na
var float orbTgt = na
var int orbT = 0
var int ibHold = 0    // the IB side held back while an ORB trade is open: 1 = the buy stop, -1 = the sell stop, 0 = none
var string lastMsg = "-"
var int t0Chart = time
var int eT = 0
var int oT = 0
var int pT = 0
var int iT = 0
bool buyNow = false
bool sellNow = false

// ---------- chart drawing: TradingView position-tool colours
color C_TPF = color.new(#089981, 80)   // target zone fill
color C_TPE = color.new(#089981, 40)   // target zone edge
color C_SLF = color.new(#F23645, 80)   // stop zone fill
color C_SLE = color.new(#F23645, 40)   // stop zone edge
color C_ENTRY = color.new(#B2B5BE, 0)  // entry line
color C_BUY = color.new(#2962FF, 0)
color C_SELL = color.new(#E91E63, 0)
color C_WIN = color.new(#089981, 0)
color C_LOSS = color.new(#F23645, 0)
// this bar's labels: slot 0 = below the bar (long entries and adds, short exits), slot 1 = above it (short entries and
// adds, long exits). Marks are collected while the bar is processed and drawn once at its end, one label per slot, so
// two trades acting on the same bar (the pyramid and the IB trade at 16:00) never hide each other's label.
array<string> MK_TXT = array.from("", "")
array<string> MK_TIP = array.from("", "")
array<color> MK_COL = array.from(color.gray, color.gray)
array<int> MK_NX = array.from(0, 0)          // exits in the slot
array<float> MK_USD = array.from(0.0, 0.0)   // their $ total
f_mark(int slot, string txt, string tip, color c) =>
    bool first = array.get(MK_TXT, slot) == ""
    array.set(MK_TXT, slot, first ? txt : array.get(MK_TXT, slot) + "\n" + txt)
    array.set(MK_TIP, slot, first ? tip : array.get(MK_TIP, slot) + "\n" + tip)
    if first
        array.set(MK_COL, slot, c)
    0
// entry: a compact BUY / SELL label with the contracts; exit: the trade's result in $ after commission
f_entryLbl(int side, int n, string tip) =>
    f_mark(side == 1 ? 0 : 1, (side == 1 ? "BUY " : "SELL ") + str.tostring(n), tip, side == 1 ? C_BUY : C_SELL)
f_exitLbl(float usd, int side, string tip) =>
    int slot = side == 1 ? 1 : 0
    array.set(MK_NX, slot, array.get(MK_NX, slot) + 1)
    array.set(MK_USD, slot, array.get(MK_USD, slot) + usd)
    string sgn = usd >= 0 ? "+$" : "-$"
    f_mark(slot, sgn + str.tostring(math.abs(usd), "#"), tip + " | " + sgn + str.tostring(math.abs(usd), "#.##") + " after commission", usd >= 0 ? C_WIN : C_LOSS)
// a zone between two prices, from this bar (the entry) to the next; f_extend moves its right edge while the trade is open
f_zone(float p1, float p2, color zFill, color zEdge) =>
    box bx = na
    if showBoxes
        bx := box.new(bar_index, math.max(p1, p2), bar_index + 1, math.min(p1, p2), border_color = zEdge, border_width = 1, bgcolor = zFill)
    bx
f_entryLine(float e) =>
    line ln = na
    if showBoxes
        ln := line.new(bar_index, e, bar_index + 1, e, color = C_ENTRY, width = 1)
    ln
f_extend(box b) =>
    if not na(b)
        box.set_right(b, bar_index)
    0
f_extendLine(line ln) =>
    if not na(ln)
        line.set_x2(ln, bar_index)
    0
// the drawings of the open trades
var box eSL = na
var box eTP = na
var line eLn = na
var box oSL = na
var line oLn = na
var box pSL = na
var line pLn = na
var box iSL = na
var box iTP = na
var line iLn = na
var box orbSL = na
var box orbTP = na
var line orbLn = na

// a session that ended before its exit time (half day / data gap) leaves nothing open: flat at its last price
if newDay and not na(close[1])
    if eSide != 0
        f_log(LOG, eT, time_close[1], "EVAL " + eName + " x" + str.tostring(eN), eSide, eEnt, close[1], (close[1] - eEnt) * eSide * eN * PV - eN * COMM, (close[1] - eEnt) * eSide / math.abs(eEnt - eStp), "session end")
        eSide := 0
    if oSide != 0
        f_log(LOG, oT, time_close[1], "Overnight x" + str.tostring(oN), oSide, oEnt, close[1], ((close[1] - oEnt) * oSide * PV - COMM) * oN, (close[1] - oEnt) * oSide / math.abs(oEnt - oStp), "session end")
        oSide := 0
    if pSide != 0
        float pUsd3 = (((close[1] - pE1) * pSide + (pNu == 2 ? (close[1] - pE2) * pSide : 0.0)) * PV - pNu * COMM) * pN
        f_log(LOG, pT, time_close[1], "Pyramid " + str.tostring(pNu * pN) + " MNQ", pSide, pE1, close[1], pUsd3, pUsd3 / (0.35 * pA * PV * pN), "session end")
        pSide := 0
    if iSide != 0
        f_log(LOG, iT, time_close[1], "IB breakout x" + str.tostring(iN), iSide, iEnt, close[1], ((close[1] - iEnt) * iSide * PV - COMM) * iN, (close[1] - iEnt) * iSide / math.abs(iEnt - iStp), "session end")
        iSide := 0
    if orbSide != 0
        f_log(LOG, orbT, time_close[1], "ORB x" + str.tostring(orbN), orbSide, orbEnt, close[1], ((close[1] - orbEnt) * orbSide * PV - COMM) * orbN, (close[1] - orbEnt) * orbSide / math.abs(orbEnt - orbStp), "session end")
        orbSide := 0
if newDay
    usedRisk := 0.0
    evalUsedToday := false
    ibArmed := false
    ibReserve := 0.0
    odToday := 0
    ibHold := 0

// ---- 1) manage open trades on this bar (entries were made at an earlier bar's close)
// the boxes of open trades reach this bar first, so a trade that exits on this bar ends here
if eSide != 0
    f_extend(eSL)
    f_extend(eTP)
    f_extendLine(eLn)
if oSide != 0
    f_extend(oSL)
    f_extendLine(oLn)
if pSide != 0
    f_extend(pSL)
    f_extendLine(pLn)
if iSide != 0
    f_extend(iSL)
    f_extend(iTP)
    f_extendLine(iLn)
if orbSide != 0
    f_extend(orbSL)
    f_extend(orbTP)
    f_extendLine(orbLn)
if eSide != 0
    bool stopHit = eSide == 1 ? low <= eStp : high >= eStp
    bool tgtHit = eSide == 1 ? high >= eTgt + TK : low <= eTgt - TK
    if stopHit or tgtHit
        float px = stopHit ? ((eSide == 1 and open <= eStp) or (eSide == -1 and open >= eStp) ? open : eStp) : eTgt
        f_exitLbl((px - eEnt) * eSide * eN * PV - eN * COMM, eSide, "Eval " + eName + " " + str.tostring(eN) + " MNQ: " + (stopHit ? "stop" : "target") + " at " + str.tostring(px, format.mintick))
        f_log(LOG, eT, time, "EVAL " + eName + " x" + str.tostring(eN), eSide, eEnt, px, (px - eEnt) * eSide * eN * PV - eN * COMM, (px - eEnt) * eSide / math.abs(eEnt - eStp), stopHit ? "stop" : "target")
        eSide := 0
if oSide != 0
    bool oHit = oSide == 1 ? low <= oStp : high >= oStp
    if oHit
        float opx = (oSide == 1 and open <= oStp) or (oSide == -1 and open >= oStp) ? open : oStp
        f_exitLbl(((opx - oEnt) * oSide * PV - COMM) * oN, oSide, (isLive ? "Live" : "Funded") + " overnight " + str.tostring(oN) + " MNQ: stop at " + str.tostring(opx, format.mintick))
        f_log(LOG, oT, time, "Overnight x" + str.tostring(oN), oSide, oEnt, opx, ((opx - oEnt) * oSide * PV - COMM) * oN, (opx - oEnt) * oSide / math.abs(oEnt - oStp), "stop")
        oSide := 0
if pSide != 0
    bool pHit = pSide == 1 ? low <= pStp : high >= pStp
    if pHit
        float ppx = (pSide == 1 and open <= pStp) or (pSide == -1 and open >= pStp) ? open : pStp
        float pUsd = (((ppx - pE1) * pSide + (pNu == 2 ? (ppx - pE2) * pSide : 0.0)) * PV - pNu * COMM) * pN
        f_exitLbl(pUsd, pSide, "Pyramid " + str.tostring(pNu * pN) + " MNQ: stop / trail at " + str.tostring(ppx, format.mintick))
        f_log(LOG, pT, time, "Pyramid " + str.tostring(pNu * pN) + " MNQ", pSide, pE1, ppx, pUsd, pUsd / (0.35 * pA * PV * pN), "stop/trail")
        alert("ONR: pyramid stopped at " + str.tostring(pStp, format.mintick) + " (" + str.tostring(pNu * pN) + " MNQ). Flat.", alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
        pSide := 0
    else
        float fav = pSide == 1 ? high : low
        if (fav - pBest) * pSide > 0
            pBest := fav
        if pNu < 2 and (pBest - pE1) * pSide >= 0.15 * pA
            float lvl = pE1 + pSide * 0.15 * pA
            // the add is a stop order: if this bar opened beyond its level it filled at the open
            pE2 := (pSide == 1 and open > lvl) or (pSide == -1 and open < lvl) ? open : lvl
            pNu := 2
            if (pE1 - pStp) * pSide > 0
                pStp := pE1
            if pSide == 1
                buyNow := true
            else
                sellNow := true
            f_mark(pSide == 1 ? 0 : 1, "ADD " + str.tostring(pN), "Pyramid add: " + str.tostring(pN) + " MNQ at " + str.tostring(pE2, format.mintick) + ", stop to breakeven " + str.tostring(pE1, format.mintick), pSide == 1 ? C_BUY : C_SELL)
            alert("ONR: ADD " + str.tostring(pN) + " MNQ at " + str.tostring(pE2, format.mintick) + " and move the stop to breakeven " + str.tostring(pE1, format.mintick), alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
        float ts = pBest - pSide * 0.25 * pA
        if (ts - pStp) * pSide > 0
            pStp := ts
if iSide != 0
    bool iStop = iSide == 1 ? low <= iStp : high >= iStp
    bool iTg = iSide == 1 ? high >= iTgt + TK : low <= iTgt - TK
    if iStop or iTg
        float ipx = iStop ? ((iSide == 1 and open <= iStp) or (iSide == -1 and open >= iStp) ? open : iStp) : iTgt
        f_exitLbl(((ipx - iEnt) * iSide * PV - COMM) * iN, iSide, "IB breakout " + str.tostring(iN) + " MNQ: " + (iStop ? "stop" : "target") + " at " + str.tostring(ipx, format.mintick))
        f_log(LOG, iT, time, "IB breakout x" + str.tostring(iN), iSide, iEnt, ipx, ((ipx - iEnt) * iSide * PV - COMM) * iN, (ipx - iEnt) * iSide / math.abs(iEnt - iStp), iStop ? "stop" : "target")
        iSide := 0
// the 5-minute ORB (v2.7): bracket stop 0.10 ADR / target 1 ADR. Checked before the IB orders, as in the backtest's
// order of events: an ORB trade that ends on this bar no longer blocks an IB fill against it on this bar
if orbSide != 0
    bool orbHitS = orbSide == 1 ? low <= orbStp : high >= orbStp
    bool orbHitT = orbSide == 1 ? high >= orbTgt + TK : low <= orbTgt - TK
    if orbHitS or orbHitT
        float orbPx = orbHitS ? ((orbSide == 1 and open <= orbStp) or (orbSide == -1 and open >= orbStp) ? open : orbStp) : orbTgt
        f_exitLbl(((orbPx - orbEnt) * orbSide * PV - COMM) * orbN, orbSide, "ORB " + str.tostring(orbN) + " MNQ: " + (orbHitS ? "stop" : "target") + " at " + str.tostring(orbPx, format.mintick))
        f_log(LOG, orbT, time, "ORB x" + str.tostring(orbN), orbSide, orbEnt, orbPx, ((orbPx - orbEnt) * orbSide * PV - COMM) * orbN, (orbPx - orbEnt) * orbSide / math.abs(orbEnt - orbStp), orbHitS ? "stop" : "target")
        orbSide := 0
if ibArmed and not evIB
    bool hu = not na(ibBuy) and high >= ibBuy
    bool hd = not na(ibSell) and low <= ibSell
    // while an ORB trade is open the IB side against it is held back (not at the broker): the price reaching it first
    // cancels the IB for the day, as in the backtest, which skips an IB fill against an open ORB trade
    bool hHeld = (ibHold == 1 and hu) or (ibHold == -1 and hd)
    bool hLive = (ibHold != 1 and hu) or (ibHold != -1 and hd)
    if hHeld and not hLive
        string heldTxt = ibHold == 1 ? "buy" : "sell"
        string ordTxt = ibHold == 1 ? "sell stop " + str.tostring(ibSell, format.mintick) : "buy stop " + str.tostring(ibBuy, format.mintick)
        ibArmed := false
        usedRisk := usedRisk - ibReserve
        ibReserve := 0.0
        ibHold := 0
        lastMsg := "IB CANCELLED for today: the price reached the held " + heldTxt + " level while the ORB trade was open - cancel your " + ordTxt
        alert("ONR: IB - cancel your " + ordTxt + " for today: the price reached the held " + heldTxt + " level while the ORB trade is open (the IB never trades against it).", alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
    else if hu and hd
        ibArmed := false
        usedRisk := usedRisk - ibReserve
        ibReserve := 0.0
        if ibHold != 0
            string fillTxt = ibHold == 1 ? "sell" : "buy"
            ibHold := 0
            lastMsg := "IB: your " + fillTxt + " stop filled in a bar that also reached the held level - not tracked here: manage it with stop 0.25 / target 0.5 ADR"
            alert("ONR: IB - your " + fillTxt + " stop filled in a bar that also reached the held level. Not tracked here: manage it with stop 0.25 ADR (" + str.tostring(0.25 * adr, format.mintick) + " pts), target 0.5 ADR, exit 16:00.", alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
        else
            lastMsg := "IB: both stop orders touched in one bar - not tracked here; the OCO kept whichever filled first: manage it with stop 0.25 / target 0.5 ADR"
            alert("ONR: IB - both stop orders touched in one bar. Your OCO kept whichever filled first: manage it with stop 0.25 ADR (" + str.tostring(0.25 * adr, format.mintick) + " pts), target 0.5 ADR, exit 16:00.", alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
    else if hu or hd
        iSide := hu ? 1 : -1
        iEnt := hu ? math.max(ibBuy, open) : math.min(ibSell, open)
        iStp := iEnt - iSide * 0.25 * adr
        iTgt := iEnt + iSide * 0.5 * adr
        ibArmed := false
        ibReserve := 0.0
        ibHold := 0
        if iSide == 1
            buyNow := true
        else
            sellNow := true
        iSL := f_zone(iEnt, iStp, C_SLF, C_SLE)
        iTP := f_zone(iEnt, iTgt, C_TPF, C_TPE)
        iLn := f_entryLine(iEnt)
        f_entryLbl(iSide, iN, "IB breakout " + (iSide == 1 ? "BUY " : "SELL ") + str.tostring(iN) + " MNQ @ " + str.tostring(iEnt, format.mintick) + " | stop " + str.tostring(iStp, format.mintick) + " | target " + str.tostring(iTgt, format.mintick) + " | exit 16:00 ET")
        alert("ONR: IB breakout filled " + (iSide == 1 ? "BUY " : "SELL ") + str.tostring(iN) + " MNQ @ " + str.tostring(iEnt, format.mintick) + " | stop " + str.tostring(iStp, format.mintick) + " | target " + str.tostring(iTgt, format.mintick) + " | exit 16:00 | cancel the other side", alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
        iT := time
        if (iSide == 1 and iEnt - low >= 0.25 * adr) or (iSide == -1 and high - iEnt >= 0.25 * adr)
            f_exitLbl(((iStp - iEnt) * iSide * PV - COMM) * iN, iSide, "IB breakout " + str.tostring(iN) + " MNQ: stopped inside its fill bar at " + str.tostring(iStp, format.mintick))
            f_log(LOG, iT, time, "IB breakout x" + str.tostring(iN), iSide, iEnt, iStp, ((iStp - iEnt) * iSide * PV - COMM) * iN, -1.0, "stop (fill bar)")
            iSide := 0
// the ORB trade has closed with the IB orders still live: the held side goes to the broker now (OCO with the other),
// so it can fill from the next bar on
if ibArmed and ibHold != 0 and orbSide == 0
    string relTxt = ibHold == 1 ? "buy stop " + str.tostring(ibBuy, format.mintick) : "sell stop " + str.tostring(ibSell, format.mintick)
    ibHold := 0
    lastMsg := "ORB trade closed: now also place the IB " + relTxt + " (OCO with the other order) until 13:00"
    alert("ONR: the ORB trade is closed - now also place the IB " + relTxt + " (OCO with the other order), live until 13:00.", alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)

// ---- 2) clock events (decisions at bar close)
if evONx
    bool hadON = (eSide != 0 and eExit == 930) or oSide != 0
    if eSide != 0 and eExit == 930
        f_exitLbl((close - eEnt) * eSide * eN * PV - eN * COMM, eSide, "Eval " + eName + " " + str.tostring(eN) + " MNQ: time exit 09:30 at " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick))
        f_log(LOG, eT, time_close, "EVAL " + eName + " x" + str.tostring(eN), eSide, eEnt, close, (close - eEnt) * eSide * eN * PV - eN * COMM, (close - eEnt) * eSide / math.abs(eEnt - eStp), "time exit")
        eSide := 0
    if oSide != 0
        f_exitLbl(((close - oEnt) * oSide * PV - COMM) * oN, oSide, (isLive ? "Live" : "Funded") + " overnight " + str.tostring(oN) + " MNQ: time exit 09:30 at " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick))
        f_log(LOG, oT, time_close, "Overnight x" + str.tostring(oN), oSide, oEnt, close, ((close - oEnt) * oSide * PV - COMM) * oN, (close - oEnt) * oSide / math.abs(oEnt - oStp), "time exit")
        oSide := 0
    if hadON
        alert("ONR: 09:30 - close the overnight position at market.", alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
if evIBend and ibArmed
    ibArmed := false
    usedRisk := usedRisk - ibReserve
    ibReserve := 0.0
    ibHold := 0
    alert("ONR: 13:00 - cancel unfilled IB stop orders.", alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
if evEOD
    bool hadPos = eSide != 0 or pSide != 0 or iSide != 0 or orbSide != 0
    if eSide != 0
        f_exitLbl((close - eEnt) * eSide * eN * PV - eN * COMM, eSide, "Eval " + eName + " " + str.tostring(eN) + " MNQ: time exit 16:00 at " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick))
        f_log(LOG, eT, time_close, "EVAL " + eName + " x" + str.tostring(eN), eSide, eEnt, close, (close - eEnt) * eSide * eN * PV - eN * COMM, (close - eEnt) * eSide / math.abs(eEnt - eStp), "time exit")
        eSide := 0
    if pSide != 0
        float pUsd2 = (((close - pE1) * pSide + (pNu == 2 ? (close - pE2) * pSide : 0.0)) * PV - pNu * COMM) * pN
        f_exitLbl(pUsd2, pSide, "Pyramid " + str.tostring(pNu * pN) + " MNQ: time exit 16:00 at " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick))
        f_log(LOG, pT, time_close, "Pyramid " + str.tostring(pNu * pN) + " MNQ", pSide, pE1, close, pUsd2, pUsd2 / (0.35 * pA * PV * pN), "time exit")
        pSide := 0
    if iSide != 0
        f_exitLbl(((close - iEnt) * iSide * PV - COMM) * iN, iSide, "IB breakout " + str.tostring(iN) + " MNQ: time exit 16:00 at " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick))
        f_log(LOG, iT, time_close, "IB breakout x" + str.tostring(iN), iSide, iEnt, close, ((close - iEnt) * iSide * PV - COMM) * iN, (close - iEnt) * iSide / math.abs(iEnt - iStp), "time exit")
        iSide := 0
    if orbSide != 0
        f_exitLbl(((close - orbEnt) * orbSide * PV - COMM) * orbN, orbSide, "ORB " + str.tostring(orbN) + " MNQ: time exit 16:00 at " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick))
        f_log(LOG, orbT, time_close, "ORB x" + str.tostring(orbN), orbSide, orbEnt, close, ((close - orbEnt) * orbSide * PV - COMM) * orbN, (close - orbEnt) * orbSide / math.abs(orbEnt - orbStp), "time exit")
        orbSide := 0
    if hadPos
        alert("ONR: 16:00 - close everything at market. Then update the account inputs.", alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
if halfDay and evEarly and (eSide != 0 or oSide != 0 or pSide != 0 or iSide != 0 or orbSide != 0)
    alert("ONR: HALF DAY - the market halts at 13:00 ET. Close everything now (12:55 ET / 9:55 AM PT).", alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
if goodFri and evGF and (eSide != 0 or oSide != 0)
    lastMsg := "GOOD FRIDAY (CME halts at 09:15 ET): close the overnight trade now"
    alert("ONR: GOOD FRIDAY - the market halts at 09:15 ET. Close the overnight position now (09:05 ET / 6:05 AM PT).", alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)

// 18:10 overnight reversion (eval trigger 1 / funded leg 1)
if evON and not na(adr) and sigSide != 0
    string sideTxt = sigSide == 1 ? "BUY" : "SELL"
    // the session this overnight trade belongs to = the calendar day 6 hours after the 18:00 open (same rule as the research)
    int sessT = time + 6 * 3600000
    bool newsNight = newsSkip and (dayofweek(sessT, TZ) == dayofweek.thursday or (dayofweek(sessT, TZ) == dayofweek.friday and dayofmonth(sessT, TZ) <= 7))
    if isEval and newsNight and not evalDone
        lastMsg := "OVERNIGHT " + sideTxt + " signal SKIPPED (08:30 news tomorrow) - the 09:35 drive can still trade"
        f_mark(sigSide == 1 ? 0 : 1, "news skip", "Overnight " + sideTxt + " signal skipped: 08:30 news tomorrow. The 09:35 opening drive can still trade.", color.gray)
        alert("ONR EVAL: overnight " + sideTxt + " signal skipped - 08:30 news tomorrow. No trade tonight; the 09:35 opening drive can still trade.", alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
    else if isEval
        if evalDone
            lastMsg := "OVERNIGHT " + sideTxt + " signal NOT traded: " + DONETXT
        else if cushion >= 50.0 * M
            [n, slp, tpp] = f_bracket(adr)
            eSide := sigSide
            eN := n
            eEnt := close
            eStp := close - sigSide * slp
            eTgt := close + sigSide * tpp
            eExit := 930
            eName := "ON"
            eT := time_close
            evalUsedToday := true
            if sigSide == 1
                buyNow := true
            else
                sellNow := true
            lastMsg := "OVERNIGHT " + sideTxt + " " + str.tostring(n) + " MNQ, stop " + str.tostring(eStp, format.mintick) + ", target " + str.tostring(eTgt, format.mintick) + ", exit 09:30"
            eSL := f_zone(close, eStp, C_SLF, C_SLE)
            eTP := f_zone(close, eTgt, C_TPF, C_TPE)
            eLn := f_entryLine(close)
            f_entryLbl(sigSide, n, "Eval overnight " + sideTxt + " " + str.tostring(n) + " MNQ @ " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) + " | stop " + str.tostring(eStp, format.mintick) + " | target " + str.tostring(eTgt, format.mintick) + " | exit 09:30 ET")
            alert("ONR EVAL: OVERNIGHT " + sideTxt + " " + str.tostring(n) + " MNQ @ ~" + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) + " | stop " + str.tostring(eStp, format.mintick) + " | target " + str.tostring(eTgt, format.mintick) + " | exit 09:30 ET", alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
        else
            lastMsg := "OVERNIGHT " + sideTxt + " signal NOT traded: eval cushion below $" + str.tostring(50.0 * M, "#")
    else
        float rk = 0.5 * adr * PV * nF
        if cushion >= 200.0 * M and usedRisk + rk <= room
            oSide := sigSide
            oN := nF
            oEnt := close
            oStp := close - sigSide * 0.5 * adr
            oT := time_close
            usedRisk := usedRisk + rk
            if sigSide == 1
                buyNow := true
            else
                sellNow := true
            lastMsg := "OVERNIGHT " + sideTxt + " " + str.tostring(nF) + " MNQ, stop " + str.tostring(oStp, format.mintick) + ", exit 09:30"
            oSL := f_zone(close, oStp, C_SLF, C_SLE)
            oLn := f_entryLine(close)
            f_entryLbl(sigSide, nF, (isLive ? "Live" : "Funded") + " overnight " + sideTxt + " " + str.tostring(nF) + " MNQ @ " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) + " | stop " + str.tostring(oStp, format.mintick) + " | no target | exit 09:30 ET")
            alert("ONR " + FTAG + ": OVERNIGHT " + sideTxt + " " + str.tostring(nF) + " MNQ @ ~" + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) + " | stop " + str.tostring(oStp, format.mintick) + " | no target | exit 09:30 ET", alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
        else
            lastMsg := "OVERNIGHT " + sideTxt + " signal NOT traded: " + (cushion < 200.0 * M ? "cushion below $" + str.tostring(200.0 * M, "#") : "risk $" + str.tostring(rk, "#") + " > day budget left $" + str.tostring(math.max(room - usedRisk, 0.0), "#"))

// 09:35 opening drive (eval trigger 2 / funded leg 2 = pyramid). Not on half days: the market halts at 13:00 ET.
if evOD and halfDay
    lastMsg := "HALF DAY (13:00 ET halt): no 09:35 / 10:30 entries today"
if evOD and not halfDay and not na(adr) and not na(rOpen)
    float d5 = (close - rOpen) / adr
    int odSide = math.abs(d5) >= 0.10 ? (d5 > 0 ? 1 : -1) : 0
    odToday := odSide
    if odSide != 0
        string sTxt = odSide == 1 ? "BUY" : "SELL"
        if isEval
            if not evalUsedToday and eSide == 0 and not evalDone and cushion >= 50.0 * M
                [n, slp, tpp] = f_bracket(adr)
                eSide := odSide
                eN := n
                eEnt := close
                eStp := close - odSide * slp
                eTgt := close + odSide * tpp
                eExit := 1320
                eName := "OD"
                eT := time_close
                evalUsedToday := true
                if odSide == 1
                    buyNow := true
                else
                    sellNow := true
                lastMsg := "OPENING DRIVE " + sTxt + " " + str.tostring(n) + " MNQ, stop " + str.tostring(eStp, format.mintick) + ", target " + str.tostring(eTgt, format.mintick) + ", exit 16:00"
                eSL := f_zone(close, eStp, C_SLF, C_SLE)
                eTP := f_zone(close, eTgt, C_TPF, C_TPE)
                eLn := f_entryLine(close)
                f_entryLbl(odSide, n, "Eval opening drive " + sTxt + " " + str.tostring(n) + " MNQ @ " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) + " | stop " + str.tostring(eStp, format.mintick) + " | target " + str.tostring(eTgt, format.mintick) + " | exit 16:00 ET")
                alert("ONR EVAL: OPENING DRIVE " + sTxt + " " + str.tostring(n) + " MNQ @ ~" + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) + " | stop " + str.tostring(eStp, format.mintick) + " | target " + str.tostring(eTgt, format.mintick) + " | exit 16:00 ET", alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
            else if not evalUsedToday and eSide == 0
                lastMsg := "OPENING DRIVE " + sTxt + " signal NOT traded: " + (evalDone ? DONETXT : "eval cushion below $" + str.tostring(50.0 * M, "#"))
        else
            float rk2 = 0.35 * adr * PV * nF
            if cushion >= 200.0 * M and usedRisk + rk2 <= room
                pSide := odSide
                pN := nF
                pE1 := close
                pA := adr
                pNu := 1
                pStp := close - odSide * 0.35 * adr
                pBest := close
                pT := time_close
                usedRisk := usedRisk + rk2
                if odSide == 1
                    buyNow := true
                else
                    sellNow := true
                lastMsg := "PYRAMID " + sTxt + " " + str.tostring(nF) + " MNQ, stop " + str.tostring(pStp, format.mintick) + ", add " + str.tostring(nF) + " at " + str.tostring(close + odSide * 0.15 * adr, format.mintick) + ", trail 0.25 ADR, exit 16:00"
                pSL := f_zone(close, pStp, C_SLF, C_SLE)
                pLn := f_entryLine(close)
                f_entryLbl(odSide, nF, "Pyramid " + sTxt + " " + str.tostring(nF) + " MNQ @ " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) + " | stop " + str.tostring(pStp, format.mintick) + " | add " + str.tostring(nF) + " at " + str.tostring(close + odSide * 0.15 * adr, format.mintick) + " | trail 0.25 ADR | exit 16:00 ET")
                alert("ONR " + FTAG + ": OPENING-DRIVE PYRAMID " + sTxt + " " + str.tostring(nF) + " MNQ @ ~" + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) + " | stop " + str.tostring(pStp, format.mintick) + " | add " + str.tostring(nF) + " MNQ at " + str.tostring(close + odSide * 0.15 * adr, format.mintick) + " then stop -> breakeven | trail 0.25 ADR (" + str.tostring(0.25 * adr, format.mintick) + " pts) | exit 16:00", alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
            else
                lastMsg := "PYRAMID " + sTxt + " signal NOT traded: " + (cushion < 200.0 * M ? "cushion below $" + str.tostring(200.0 * M, "#") : "risk $" + str.tostring(rk2, "#") + " > day budget left $" + str.tostring(math.max(room - usedRisk, 0.0), "#"))
    // v2.7 5-minute ORB (funded leg 3): the same first 5 minutes at a lower bar (>= 0.05 ADR), taken after the pyramid,
    // so it always faces the pyramid's way; never in an eval
    int orbSig = math.abs(d5) >= 0.05 ? (d5 > 0 ? 1 : -1) : 0
    if ORBON and not isEval and orbSig != 0
        string orbTxt = orbSig == 1 ? "BUY" : "SELL"
        float rk4 = 0.10 * adr * PV * nF
        if cushion >= 200.0 * M and usedRisk + rk4 <= room
            orbSide := orbSig
            orbN := nF
            orbEnt := close
            orbStp := close - orbSig * 0.10 * adr
            orbTgt := close + orbSig * adr
            orbT := time_close
            usedRisk := usedRisk + rk4
            if orbSig == 1
                buyNow := true
            else
                sellNow := true
            string orbMsg = "ORB " + orbTxt + " " + str.tostring(nF) + " MNQ, stop " + str.tostring(orbStp, format.mintick) + ", target " + str.tostring(orbTgt, format.mintick) + ", exit 16:00"
            lastMsg := odSide != 0 ? lastMsg + " | " + orbMsg : orbMsg
            orbSL := f_zone(close, orbStp, C_SLF, C_SLE)
            orbTP := f_zone(close, orbTgt, C_TPF, C_TPE)
            orbLn := f_entryLine(close)
            f_entryLbl(orbSig, nF, "5-min ORB " + orbTxt + " " + str.tostring(nF) + " MNQ @ " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) + " | stop " + str.tostring(orbStp, format.mintick) + " | target " + str.tostring(orbTgt, format.mintick) + " | exit 16:00 ET")
            alert("ONR " + FTAG + ": 5-MIN ORB " + orbTxt + " " + str.tostring(nF) + " MNQ @ ~" + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) + " | stop " + str.tostring(orbStp, format.mintick) + " (0.10 ADR) | target " + str.tostring(orbTgt, format.mintick) + " (1 ADR) | exit 16:00", alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
        else
            string orbNo = "ORB " + orbTxt + " signal NOT traded: " + (cushion < 200.0 * M ? "cushion below $" + str.tostring(200.0 * M, "#") : "risk $" + str.tostring(rk4, "#") + " > day budget left $" + str.tostring(math.max(room - usedRisk, 0.0), "#"))
            lastMsg := odSide != 0 ? lastMsg + " | " + orbNo : orbNo

// 10:30 IB breakout orders (funded leg 4; its risk is reserved while the orders are live). On a 09:35-drive day only the
// drive's side is placed: no position ever opposes the pyramid or an eval's 09:35 trade on another account (Lucid's
// hedging rule; v2 could hold long and short together). Backtest: against-drive IB trades were the weakest group.
// v2.7: with an ORB trade still open on a day without a drive, the side against it is held back until that trade closes.
if evIB and not isEval and not halfDay and not na(adr) and not na(ibH)
    float rk3 = 0.25 * adr * PV * nF
    if cushion >= 200.0 * M and usedRisk + rk3 <= room
        ibBuy := odToday >= 0 ? ibH + TK : na
        ibSell := odToday <= 0 ? ibL - TK : na
        ibHold := odToday == 0 and orbSide != 0 ? -orbSide : 0
        ibArmed := true
        iN := nF
        ibReserve := rk3
        usedRisk := usedRisk + rk3
        string holdTxt = ibHold == -1 ? "buy stop " + str.tostring(ibBuy, format.mintick) + " now, with the open ORB trade; the sell stop " + str.tostring(ibSell, format.mintick) + " waits until that trade closes (if the price reaches it first, cancel the IB for today)" : "sell stop " + str.tostring(ibSell, format.mintick) + " now, with the open ORB trade; the buy stop " + str.tostring(ibBuy, format.mintick) + " waits until that trade closes (if the price reaches it first, cancel the IB for today)"
        string ibTxt = ibHold != 0 ? holdTxt : odToday == 0 ? "OCO buy stop " + str.tostring(ibBuy, format.mintick) + " / sell stop " + str.tostring(ibSell, format.mintick) : (odToday == 1 ? "buy stop " + str.tostring(ibBuy, format.mintick) + " only (with the 09:35 drive)" : "sell stop " + str.tostring(ibSell, format.mintick) + " only (with the 09:35 drive)")
        lastMsg := "IB " + str.tostring(nF) + " MNQ until 13:00: " + ibTxt
        alert("ONR " + FTAG + ": IB BREAKOUT " + str.tostring(nF) + " MNQ | " + ibTxt + " | stop 0.25 ADR (" + str.tostring(0.25 * adr, format.mintick) + " pts) | target 0.5 ADR (" + str.tostring(0.5 * adr, format.mintick) + " pts) | cancel at 13:00 | exit 16:00", alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
    else
        lastMsg := "IB breakout NOT placed: " + (cushion < 200.0 * M ? "cushion below $" + str.tostring(200.0 * M, "#") : "risk $" + str.tostring(rk3, "#") + " > day budget left $" + str.tostring(math.max(room - usedRisk, 0.0), "#"))

// ---------- this bar's labels (collected above): at most one below and one above the bar
if showLevels
    for slot = 0 to 1
        string mt = array.get(MK_TXT, slot)
        if mt != ""
            color mc = array.get(MK_NX, slot) > 0 ? (array.get(MK_USD, slot) >= 0 ? C_WIN : C_LOSS) : array.get(MK_COL, slot)
            label.new(bar_index, slot == 0 ? low : high, mt, style = slot == 0 ? label.style_label_up : label.style_label_down, color = mc, textcolor = color.white, size = size.small, tooltip = array.get(MK_TIP, slot))

// ---------- lines the boxes do not show: the pyramid's moving stop and the IB stop orders waiting to fill (gray: an IB
// side held back while an ORB trade is open)
plot(pSide != 0 ? pStp : na, "Pyramid stop (moves)", color.orange, 2, plot.style_linebr)
plot(ibArmed and ibHold != 1 ? ibBuy : na, "IB buy stop order", color.purple, 1, plot.style_linebr)
plot(ibArmed and ibHold != -1 ? ibSell : na, "IB sell stop order", color.purple, 1, plot.style_linebr)
plot(ibArmed and ibHold != 0 ? (ibHold == 1 ? ibBuy : ibSell) : na, "IB side held back (ORB trade open)", color.gray, 1, plot.style_linebr)
alertcondition(buyNow, "ONR BUY", "ONR: BUY signal - check the alert message / panel for size, stop and target")
alertcondition(sellNow, "ONR SELL", "ONR: SELL signal - check the alert message / panel for size, stop and target")

// ---------- live alarm levels: block bootstrap (10-session blocks, 20,000 paths) of one 50K funded account's daily trade P&L,
// Nov 15 2021 - Nov 20 2026 backtest on your MNQ file (5-minute bars, as recorded; the indicator's trading rules, $1.00
// commission); median, 5th pct = yellow, 1st pct = red; scaled by size
f_interp(float d, array<float> xs, array<float> ys) =>
    float out = array.get(ys, 0)
    if d >= array.get(xs, array.size(xs) - 1)
        out := array.get(ys, array.size(ys) - 1)
    else if d > array.get(xs, 0)
        for k = 0 to array.size(xs) - 2
            float x0 = array.get(xs, k)
            float x1 = array.get(xs, k + 1)
            if d >= x0 and d <= x1
                out := array.get(ys, k) + (array.get(ys, k + 1) - array.get(ys, k)) * (d - x0) / (x1 - x0)
    out
var array<float> AX = array.from(20.0, 40.0, 60.0, 120.0, 250.0)
var array<float> AMED = array.from(1549.0, 3195.0, 4861.0, 9878.0, 20920.0)
var array<float> AYEL = array.from(-3126.0, -3569.0, -3574.0, -1969.0, 3295.0)
var array<float> ARED = array.from(-5063.0, -6261.0, -6766.0, -6853.0, -3622.0)
// the same test with the v2.7 ORB leg (backtest/onr/r7_v27.py, results_r7/v27_alarm_bands.csv): used while it is on
var array<float> AMEDB = array.from(1735.0, 3840.0, 5890.0, 12248.0, 26128.0)
var array<float> AYELB = array.from(-3574.0, -4184.0, -4078.0, -2465.0, 4170.0)
var array<float> AREDB = array.from(-5452.0, -6899.0, -7842.0, -7934.0, -4170.0)

// ---------- next step on the clock (ET and PT)
f_nextStep(bool ev, bool orb) =>
    int m = hour(timenow, TZ) * 60 + minute(timenow, TZ)
    int dw = dayofweek(timenow, TZ)
    bool wkend = dw == dayofweek.saturday or (dw == dayofweek.sunday and m < 18 * 60) or (dw == dayofweek.friday and m >= 16 * 60)
    string s = ""
    if wkend
        s := "Weekend. Next: Sunday 18:10 ET / 3:10 PM PT overnight check. Update the Live tracking inputs."
    else if m < 9 * 60 + 30
        s := ev ? "09:30 ET / 6:30 AM PT: exit any overnight trade. Then 09:35 ET / 6:35 AM PT: opening-drive check (only if no overnight trade)." : "09:30 ET / 6:30 AM PT: exit any overnight trade. 09:35 ET / 6:35 AM PT: opening-drive pyramid check" + (orb ? " and the 5-minute ORB (first 5 min >= 0.05 ADR)." : ".")
    else if m < 9 * 60 + 35
        s := "09:35 ET / 6:35 AM PT: opening-drive check (first 5 min >= 0.10 ADR" + (orb and not ev ? "; the ORB from 0.05 ADR)." : ").")
    else if m < 10 * 60 + 30
        s := ev ? "Manage the trade (stop / target on chart). Exit 16:00 ET / 1:00 PM PT." : "10:30 ET / 7:30 AM PT: place the IB breakout order - only the 09:35 drive's side on a drive day, else buy-stop + sell-stop (OCO)" + (orb ? "; while an ORB trade is open, only its side." : ".")
    else if m < 13 * 60
        s := ev ? "Manage the trade. Exit 16:00 ET / 1:00 PM PT." : "IB orders live until 13:00 ET / 10:00 AM PT, then cancel unfilled. Exit everything 16:00 ET / 1:00 PM PT."
    else if m < 16 * 60
        s := "Exit everything at 16:00 ET / 1:00 PM PT. Then update the Account inputs."
    else if m < 18 * 60 + 10
        s := "18:10 ET / 3:10 PM PT: overnight check (score row above; final after 16:00)."
    else
        s := "Overnight trade (if any) runs to 09:30 ET / 6:30 AM PT. Next: 09:35 ET / 6:35 AM PT opening drive."
    s

// ---------- panel
var table T = table.new(position.top_right, 2, 13, border_width = 1)
if showPanel and barstate.islast
    float sincePay = pnlNow - pnlAfterPay
    // payout ready (as in the backtest): Lucid and Topstep Standard 5 qualifying days; Topstep Consistency 3 traded days with
    // no day above 40% of the profit since the last payout. Both firms: the account is $1,000 up and up since the last payout.
    bool payReady = TSCONS ? (qDays >= 3 and bestDay <= 0.4 * sincePay) : qDays >= 5
    bool eligible = isFunded and nPay < PAYMAX and payReady and pnlNow >= 1000.0 and sincePay > 0.0
    float payAmt = math.min(PAYCAP, 0.5 * pnlNow)  // the maximum the firm allows: 50% of the profit (the balance) up to the size's cap
    string bracketTxt = (SPAN == 1.0 ? "wide" : SPAN == 0.75 ? "medium" : "tight") + " bracket" + (newsSkip ? ", news skip" : "")
    string needTxt = " | " + acctSize + (evalNeed > 0.0 ? " | need $" + str.tostring(evalNeed, "#") + " more" : " | profit target reached")
    string evalTxt = TS ? "COMBINE (Topstep" + (TSLAB ? " 25K Static, max loss fixed at -$1,000, $500 daily loss limit" : "") + ": best day <= 55%; plan days <= 50%, " + bracketTxt + ")" + needTxt : "EVAL (" + (CONS == 0.5 ? "50%" : "40%") + " rule, " + bracketTxt + ")" + needTxt
    string tsPayTxt = TSCONS ? "days traded " + str.tostring(qDays) + "/3 | best day $" + str.tostring(bestDay, "#") + " (max 40% = $" + str.tostring(math.max(0.4 * sincePay, 0.0), "#") + ")" : "winning days (>= $150) " + str.tostring(qDays) + "/5"
    string fundTxt = TS ? "XFA " + acctSize + (TSLAB ? " Static" : "") + " (Topstep, " + (TSCONS ? "Consistency" : "Standard") + " payouts) | payouts " + str.tostring(nPay) + " (no limit) | " + tsPayTxt + " | since last payout $" + str.tostring(sincePay, "#") : "FUNDED " + acctSize + " | payouts " + str.tostring(nPay) + "/" + str.tostring(PAYMAX) + " | qualifying days (>= $" + str.tostring(QDAY, "#") + ") " + str.tostring(qDays) + "/5 | since last payout $" + str.tostring(sincePay, "#")
    string liveTxt = TS ? "LIVE at Topstep: not modelled (trades the FUNDED plan)" : "LIVE " + acctSize + " | live P&L $" + str.tostring(pnlNow, "#") + " | drawdown " + (liveLocked ? "locked at +$100" : "trailing $" + str.tostring(MLL, "#") + " until live profit reaches it") + " | keep a $" + str.tostring(MLL, "#") + " cushion"
    string acct = isEval ? evalTxt : (isLive ? liveTxt : fundTxt)
    string sigTxt = na(score) ? "warming up" : (str.tostring(score, "#.##") + " (" + (sigSide == 1 ? "BUY tonight" : sigSide == -1 ? "SELL tonight" : "no overnight trade") + ", needs |score| >= 0.72; final after the 16:00 close)")
    string warn = "-"
    if tfMin == 0 or tfMin > 5
        warn := "Use a 1-5 minute chart"
    else if onBars == 0
        warn := "No overnight bars on this chart: switch it to the 24h (ETH) session"
    else if TS and isLive
        warn := "Topstep live account: not modelled. The trades are the FUNDED plan; follow Topstep's own drawdown and payout rules"
    else if evalDone
        warn := "No new trades on this " + (TS ? "Combine" : "eval") + ": " + DONETXT
    else if isEval and cushion < 50.0 * M
        warn := TS ? "Combine cushion below $" + str.tostring(50.0 * M, "#") + ": this Combine can no longer trade - " + (TSLAB ? "buy a new one (the 25K cannot be reset)" : "reset it or start a new one") : "Eval cushion below $" + str.tostring(50.0 * M, "#") + ": this eval can no longer trade - buy a new one"
    else if isFunded and nPay >= PAYMAX
        warn := PAYMAX == 4 ? "4 payouts taken: CLOSE this account now (a 5th payout moves you live and Lucid closes ALL your sim accounts) - refill the slot from an eval" : "5 payouts taken: Lucid moves you live and closes every sim account - set Phase to LIVE on each live account"
    else if not isEval and cushion < 200.0 * M
        warn := isLive ? "LIVE cushion below $" + str.tostring(200.0 * M, "#") + ": stop trading this live account - once none is left, buy evals again after Lucid's 2-week wait" : "ABANDON: cushion < $" + str.tostring(200.0 * M, "#") + (TS ? " - start a new Combine" : " - buy a new eval")
    else if eligible
        warn := TS ? "REQUEST $" + str.tostring(payAmt, "#") + " PAYOUT NOW (Topstep " + (TSCONS ? "Consistency" : "Standard") + " path: 50% of the balance, cap $" + str.tostring(PAYCAP, "#") + ")" : "REQUEST $" + str.tostring(payAmt, "#") + " PAYOUT NOW (the maximum allowed: 50% of profit, cap $" + str.tostring(PAYCAP, "#") + ")" + (nPay == PAYMAX - 1 ? (PAYMAX == 4 ? " - your 4th and last: close this account once it is paid" : " - your 5th: Lucid then moves you live") : "")
    else if isLive and liveLocked and pnlNow > MLL + 100.0
        warn := "WITHDRAW $" + str.tostring(pnlNow - MLL - 100.0, "#") + " (everything above $" + str.tostring(MLL + 100.0, "#") + ", keeping a $" + str.tostring(MLL, "#") + " cushion)"
    else if isLive and not liveLocked
        warn := "LIVE: no withdrawal until live profit reaches $" + str.tostring(MLL, "#") + " (a payout before that locks the drawdown at +$100 at once)"
    string orbHead = not ORBON or isEval ? "" : TS ? " | ORB leg ON (v2.7), same test: 50K ~$90.5k/yr (worst full year +$43.3k), 150K ~$185.4k; 25K ~$35.8k, 100K ~$141.4k (worst full year +$59.4k)" : " | ORB leg ON (v2.7), same test at 50K: ~" + (CONS == 0.5 ? "$62.3k/yr with the add-on (2023-26 ~$63.5k vs ~$59.0k without the leg)" : "$55.2k/yr (2023-26 ~$49.9k vs ~$60.7k without the leg)")
    table.cell(T, 0, 0, "ONR Book v2.7 (50%)", bgcolor = color.new(color.navy, 0), text_color = color.white)
    table.cell(T, 1, 0, (TS ? "Backtest Nov 2021 - Nov 2026 on your MNQ file, Topstep, 5 XFAs + 5 Combines, Standard payouts, No Activation Fee path: 50K ~$73.1k/yr (worst full year +$47.5k), 100K ~$122.1k (+$94.9k), 150K ~$136.0k (+$41.1k); Consistency payouts ~$42.6k / $58.7k / $84.3k; 25K Static (5 Combines a month): Standard ~$32.2k (+$10.1k), Consistency ~$32.2k (+$6.9k) | Topstep's call-up to live is not modelled: a best case | not live-tested" : "Lucid backtest Nov 2021 - Nov 2026 on your MNQ file (50K, 50% add-on, $98.20 evals): eval pass 43.2%, first payout median 53 days; 5 funded + 5 evals closing each account after its 4th payout ~$58.3k/yr (every full year positive, longest gap ~6 mo); taking 5th payouts and going live ~$65.2k/yr | not live-tested") + orbHead, bgcolor = color.new(color.navy, 0), text_color = color.yellow)
    table.cell(T, 0, 1, "Account", text_color = color.white, bgcolor = color.new(color.gray, 40))
    table.cell(T, 1, 1, acct, text_color = color.white, bgcolor = color.new(color.gray, 40))
    table.cell(T, 0, 2, "Cushion / day budget", text_color = color.white, bgcolor = color.new(color.gray, 40))
    table.cell(T, 1, 2, "$" + str.tostring(cushion, "#") + " / $" + str.tostring(math.max(room, 0.0), "#") + (TSLAB ? " ($500 daily loss limit)" : "") + (isEval ? "" : " | " + (isLive ? "live" : "funded") + " size " + str.tostring(nF) + " MNQ per leg" + (fundAuto ? (TS ? " (auto, Topstep cap " + str.tostring(FUNDMAX) + ")" : " (auto)") : " (fixed)") + ", up to " + str.tostring((ORBON ? 4 : 3) * nF) + " MNQ open at once | ORB leg " + (ORBON ? "on" : "off")), text_color = color.white, bgcolor = color.new(color.gray, 40))
    table.cell(T, 0, 3, "S&P stretch score", text_color = color.white, bgcolor = color.new(color.gray, 40))
    table.cell(T, 1, 3, sigTxt, text_color = sigSide == 0 ? color.white : color.yellow, bgcolor = color.new(color.gray, 40))
    table.cell(T, 0, 4, "NQ ADR (14 RTH days)", text_color = color.white, bgcolor = color.new(color.gray, 40))
    table.cell(T, 1, 4, na(adr) ? "warming up (needs 14 sessions on chart)" : str.tostring(adr, "#.##") + " pts", text_color = color.white, bgcolor = color.new(color.gray, 40))
    table.cell(T, 0, 5, "Last instruction", text_color = color.white, bgcolor = color.new(color.gray, 40))
    table.cell(T, 1, 5, lastMsg, text_color = color.white, bgcolor = color.new(color.gray, 40))
    table.cell(T, 0, 6, "Open now", text_color = color.white, bgcolor = color.new(color.gray, 40))
    string openTxt = (eSide != 0 ? eName + " " + str.tostring(eN) + " | " : "") + (oSide != 0 ? "ON " + str.tostring(oN) + " | " : "") + (pSide != 0 ? "PYR " + str.tostring(pNu * pN) + " stop " + str.tostring(pStp, format.mintick) + " | " : "") + (iSide != 0 ? "IB " + str.tostring(iN) + " | " : "") + (orbSide != 0 ? "ORB " + str.tostring(orbN) + " | " : "") + (ibArmed ? (ibHold != 0 ? "IB order live (one side held back)" : "IB orders live") : "")
    table.cell(T, 1, 6, openTxt == "" ? "flat" : openTxt, text_color = color.white, bgcolor = color.new(color.gray, 40))
    table.cell(T, 0, 7, "Action", text_color = color.white, bgcolor = color.new(color.gray, 40))
    table.cell(T, 1, 7, warn, text_color = warn == "-" ? color.white : color.yellow, bgcolor = color.new(color.gray, 40))
    table.cell(T, 0, 8, "Today's eval trigger", text_color = color.white, bgcolor = color.new(color.gray, 40))
    table.cell(T, 1, 8, isEval ? (evalDone ? "none: the profit target is reached" : evalUsedToday ? "used (one eval trade per day)" : (goodFri ? "Good Friday (09:15 ET halt): no 09:35 drive" : halfDay ? "half day: overnight trade only" : "waiting: 18:10 overnight -> 09:35 drive")) : "-", text_color = color.white, bgcolor = color.new(color.gray, 40))
    string nxt = goodFri ? (timenow < halfEnd ? "GOOD FRIDAY (CME halts at 09:15 ET): close any overnight trade by 09:10 ET / 6:10 AM PT; no 09:35 / 10:30 trades." : "Good Friday: the market is closed. Next: Sunday 18:10 ET / 3:10 PM PT overnight check.") : halfDay ? (timenow < halfEnd ? "HALF DAY (13:00 ET halt): exit the overnight trade at 09:30, no new trades, flat by 12:55 ET / 9:55 AM PT." : "Half day over (13:00 ET halt). Next: 18:10 ET / 3:10 PM PT overnight check once the next session opens.") : f_nextStep(isEval, ORBON)
    table.cell(T, 0, 9, "Next step", text_color = color.white, bgcolor = color.new(color.gray, 40))
    table.cell(T, 1, 9, nxt, text_color = halfDay or goodFri ? color.orange : color.aqua, bgcolor = color.new(color.gray, 40))
    float bandScale = M / 2.0  // bands are for 50K (M = 2)
    bool orbBands = ORBON and not isEval   // the bands of the same test with the v2.7 ORB leg
    float yl = (orbBands ? f_interp(liveDays, AX, AYELB) : f_interp(liveDays, AX, AYEL)) * bandScale
    float rd = (orbBands ? f_interp(liveDays, AX, AREDB) : f_interp(liveDays, AX, ARED)) * bandScale
    float md = (liveDays >= 20 ? (orbBands ? f_interp(liveDays, AX, AMEDB) : f_interp(liveDays, AX, AMED)) : (orbBands ? array.get(AMEDB, 0) : array.get(AMED, 0)) * liveDays / 20.0) * bandScale
    string alarmTxt = liveDays == 0 ? "enter your live trading days + P&L (Live tracking inputs)" : ("day " + str.tostring(liveDays) + ": $" + str.tostring(livePnl, "#") + " vs typical $" + str.tostring(md, "#") + " | yellow < $" + str.tostring(yl, "#") + " | red < $" + str.tostring(rd, "#") + (liveDays < 20 ? " (bands start at day 20)" : "") + (orbBands ? " | bands with the ORB leg" : ""))
    color alarmCol = liveDays == 0 ? color.white : (livePnl < rd ? color.red : (livePnl < yl ? color.yellow : color.lime))
    string alarmHead = liveDays == 0 ? "Live alarm" : (livePnl < rd ? "Live alarm: RED - STOP" : (livePnl < yl ? "Live alarm: YELLOW" : "Live alarm: GREEN"))
    table.cell(T, 0, 10, alarmHead, text_color = alarmCol, bgcolor = color.new(color.gray, 40))
    table.cell(T, 1, 10, alarmTxt, text_color = alarmCol, bgcolor = color.new(color.gray, 40))
    string nextTs = not TS ? "Topstep plan only (Prop firm = Topstep)" : na(adr) ? "warming up (needs the NQ ADR)" : not plan150 ? "50K (150K once your spare cash reaches $25,000: tick the PLAN input)" : adr >= 151.0 ? "150K (NQ ADR " + str.tostring(adr, "#") + " >= 151: a 150K XFA trades at full size)" : "50K (NQ ADR " + str.tostring(adr, "#") + " < 151: a 150K XFA would be capped at 10 MNQ a leg)"
    table.cell(T, 0, 11, "Next Topstep Combine", text_color = color.white, bgcolor = color.new(color.gray, 40))
    table.cell(T, 1, 11, nextTs, text_color = TS and plan150 and not na(adr) ? color.yellow : color.white, bgcolor = color.new(color.gray, 40))

// ---------- last 30 trades (simulated on this chart's bars: fills estimated from bar highs/lows, commission input included)
var table TL = table.new(logPos == "Bottom right" ? position.bottom_right : logPos == "Top left" ? position.top_left : logPos == "Middle left" ? position.middle_left : position.bottom_left, 7, 33, border_width = 1)
if showLog and barstate.islast
    table.clear(TL, 0, 0, 6, 32)
    color hb = color.new(color.navy, 0)
    color rb = color.new(color.gray, 40)
    table.cell(TL, 0, 0, "Last 30 trades (" + (TS ? "Topstep " : "Lucid ") + phase + ", " + acctSize + ") - simulated on this chart's bars, $" + str.tostring(COMM, "#.##") + "/MNQ commission in | sizes = your CURRENT inputs | R = result / stop", bgcolor = hb, text_color = color.yellow, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.merge_cells(TL, 0, 0, 6, 0)
    table.cell(TL, 0, 1, "Entered (ET)", bgcolor = hb, text_color = color.white, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(TL, 1, 1, "Trade", bgcolor = hb, text_color = color.white, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(TL, 2, 1, "Side", bgcolor = hb, text_color = color.white, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(TL, 3, 1, "Entry -> Exit", bgcolor = hb, text_color = color.white, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(TL, 4, 1, "$", bgcolor = hb, text_color = color.white, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(TL, 5, 1, "R", bgcolor = hb, text_color = color.white, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(TL, 6, 1, "Exit (ET)", bgcolor = hb, text_color = color.white, text_size = size.tiny)
    int nT = array.size(LOG)
    int wins = 0
    float net = 0.0
    float sumR = 0.0
    if nT > 0
        for k = 0 to nT - 1
            Trade tr = array.get(LOG, nT - 1 - k)
            int row = 2 + k
            color fc = tr.usd > 0 ? color.lime : (tr.usd < 0 ? color.red : color.white)
            table.cell(TL, 0, row, str.format_time(tr.t, "MM-dd HH:mm", TZ), bgcolor = rb, text_color = color.white, text_size = size.tiny)
            table.cell(TL, 1, row, tr.nm, bgcolor = rb, text_color = color.white, text_size = size.tiny)
            table.cell(TL, 2, row, tr.sd == 1 ? "BUY" : "SELL", bgcolor = rb, text_color = tr.sd == 1 ? color.lime : color.red, text_size = size.tiny)
            table.cell(TL, 3, row, str.tostring(tr.ent, format.mintick) + " -> " + str.tostring(tr.ex, format.mintick), bgcolor = rb, text_color = color.white, text_size = size.tiny)
            table.cell(TL, 4, row, (tr.usd >= 0 ? "+" : "") + str.tostring(tr.usd, "#"), bgcolor = rb, text_color = fc, text_size = size.tiny)
            table.cell(TL, 5, row, str.tostring(tr.r, "#.##"), bgcolor = rb, text_color = fc, text_size = size.tiny)
            table.cell(TL, 6, row, tr.why + " " + str.format_time(tr.tx, "HH:mm", TZ), bgcolor = rb, text_color = color.white, text_size = size.tiny)
            if tr.usd > 0
                wins := wins + 1
            net := net + tr.usd
            sumR := sumR + tr.r
    string more = nT >= 30 ? "" : (" | chart history starts " + str.format_time(t0Chart, "yyyy-MM-dd", TZ) + (tfMin > 0 and tfMin < 5 ? " - 5-min bars load " + str.tostring(5.0 / tfMin, "#.#") + "x more days" : " (TradingView bar limit)"))
    string summ = nT == 0 ? "no closed trades on the loaded history yet" + more : (str.tostring(nT) + " trades | won " + str.tostring(wins) + " (" + str.tostring(100.0 * wins / nT, "#") + "%) | net $" + str.tostring(net, "#") + " | avg R " + str.tostring(sumR / nT, "#.##") + more)
    table.cell(TL, 0, 32, summ, bgcolor = hb, text_color = net >= 0 ? color.lime : color.red, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.merge_cells(TL, 0, 32, 6, 32)
